(624724, 64029, 11181, '<td valign="top">A great idea but unfortunately not executed well enough. Its too off-focus and the lighting a bit poor. In situations like these i would have used a tripod with a longer exposure instead. You don''t need a fancy camera to make great pictures just know your camera''s capabilities. I''m sure your camera has the "night shot" option (the one with the moon shape) so you can take pictures under these lighting (or lack of it) conditions. A good effort nevertheless! 3</td>', 'A great idea but unfortunately not executed well enough. Its too off-focus and the lighting a bit poor. In situations like these i would have used a tripod with a longer exposure instead. You don''t need a fancy camera to make great pictures just know your camera''s capabilities. I''m sure your camera has the "night shot" option (the one with the moon shape) so you can take pictures under these lighting (or lack of it) conditions. A good effort nevertheless! 3', '2004-03-17 03:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
