(624828, 64988, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great shot, not sure I see the lines here though. See why you were tempted to send it in, good eye.</td>', 'Great shot, not sure I see the lines here though. See why you were tempted to send it in, good eye.', '2004-03-17 05:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
