(625215, 64398, 9285, '<td valign="top">I like the composition .... but the background and the lighting can be improved! a 7 for me..</td>', 'I like the composition .... but the background and the lighting can be improved! a 7 for me..', '2004-03-17 09:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(625216, 64758, 9285, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful beautiful shot.. I would love to have a shot like this... but I can''t see the parallel theme in it other then how the drummers are lined up... It''ll be a 6 for me.. sorry. :o)</td>', 'This is a beautiful beautiful shot.. I would love to have a shot like this... but I can''t see the parallel theme in it other then how the drummers are lined up... It''ll be a 6 for me.. sorry. :o)', '2004-03-17 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(625217, 65015, 10634, '<td valign="top">This must have taken a lot of time to set up. Very nice!</td>', 'This must have taken a lot of time to set up. Very nice!', '2004-03-17 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(625220, 64452, 16399, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is really nice. I wish I knew what it was. :)</td>', 'Wow. This is really nice. I wish I knew what it was. :)', '2004-03-17 10:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(625221, 64838, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape..would be interested to know where this is.. as it is very like the scenery not too far from where I live.<br/>Not a great many Parallel lines in this but just enough to make it count.<br/>Great colours and composition..very well done..9</td>', 'Beautiful landscape..would be interested to know where this is.. as it is very like the scenery not too far from where I live.Not a great many Parallel lines in this but just enough to make it count.Great colours and composition..very well done..9', '2004-03-17 10:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(625223, 64444, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and composition</td>', 'Nice colour and composition', '2004-03-17 10:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(625225, 65016, 14603, '<td valign="top">Like the composition here..very pleasing image.</td>', 'Like the composition here..very pleasing image.', '2004-03-17 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(625226, 64587, 16399, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. I just wish the image was a bit crisper.</td>', 'I like the idea. I just wish the image was a bit crisper.', '2004-03-17 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(625228, 64480, 16399, '<td valign="top">MMMMM! TT!</td>', 'MMMMM! TT!', '2004-03-17 10:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(625231, 64702, 2344, '<td valign="top">I look at this image and I dont immediately think of parallel lines. The lines as shown in this image aren''t parallel looking at all. They''re wavy looking (even if I know they are parallel on the flag itself) While I dont think this is very original at all I''m not going to give you a low score based on that or the message it conveys. I''ve seen an american flag before and the colours are bright and vibrant. The colours in this image look subdued and flat. Better lighting and a different arrangement of the lines in this picture would have yielded a higher score from me.</td>', 'I look at this image and I dont immediately think of parallel lines. The lines as shown in this image aren''t parallel looking at all. They''re wavy looking (even if I know they are parallel on the flag itself) While I dont think this is very original at all I''m not going to give you a low score based on that or the message it conveys. I''ve seen an american flag before and the colours are bright and vibrant. The colours in this image look subdued and flat. Better lighting and a different arrangement of the lines in this picture would have yielded a higher score from me.', '2004-03-17 10:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(625234, 64886, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very like the Scottish Highlands here.<br/>Good image, nicely composed but looks a little bit underexposed ..IMO..needs an injection of colour and and a little more light to bring it to life.</td>', 'Very like the Scottish Highlands here.Good image, nicely composed but looks a little bit underexposed ..IMO..needs an injection of colour and and a little more light to bring it to life.', '2004-03-17 10:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(625237, 64512, 2344, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of the more creative approaches to a flag shot. I"ll give you that much. While it''s still a flag shot and I think they''re a controversial subject there are some things I dont like about it. The right half of your picture is nice and bright while the left half of your picture is dark and flat.</td>', 'This has got to be one of the more creative approaches to a flag shot. I"ll give you that much. While it''s still a flag shot and I think they''re a controversial subject there are some things I dont like about it. The right half of your picture is nice and bright while the left half of your picture is dark and flat.', '2004-03-17 10:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(625239, 65001, 10785, '<td valign="top">If you could have just rotated to get that line of light in the middle of the statue, that would have been more awesome!</td>', 'If you could have just rotated to get that line of light in the middle of the statue, that would have been more awesome!', '2004-03-17 10:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(625240, 64414, 2344, '<td valign="top">The lines are strong, yes. I''m not particularly fond of this photo, not because it''s of an american flag but because technically it can be a lot better. The colours are dark and flat, maybe the photo was under exposed? The entire image has a blue cast to it.. which might be fixable with photoshop. This image could potentially be very good if it weren''t for the technical problems holding it back. 4</td>', 'The lines are strong, yes. I''m not particularly fond of this photo, not because it''s of an american flag but because technically it can be a lot better. The colours are dark and flat, maybe the photo was under exposed? The entire image has a blue cast to it.. which might be fixable with photoshop. This image could potentially be very good if it weren''t for the technical problems holding it back. 4', '2004-03-17 10:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(625241, 64237, 10785, '<td valign="top">This should be a ribbon winner! Another 10!</td>', 'This should be a ribbon winner! Another 10!', '2004-03-17 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(625243, 64780, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best shots of the challenge. a top three indeed! One of the few tens I am giving!</td>', 'This is one of the best shots of the challenge. a top three indeed! One of the few tens I am giving!', '2004-03-17 10:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(625245, 64576, 2344, '<td valign="top">Keep the shoes for the orange challenge!!!! very cute and interesting idea. I would lose the black pants and go for bare legs or something lighter. Very good. 7... no 8!</td>', 'Keep the shoes for the orange challenge!!!! very cute and interesting idea. I would lose the black pants and go for bare legs or something lighter. Very good. 7... no 8!', '2004-03-17 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(625246, 64981, 318, '<td valign="top">Clever. But needs more seperation from the background.</td>', 'Clever. But needs more seperation from the background.', '2004-03-17 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(625249, 64818, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge.</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge.', '2004-03-17 10:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(625251, 64762, 17166, '<td valign="top">Cool shape, kinda reminds me of the old Enron logo.</td>', 'Cool shape, kinda reminds me of the old Enron logo.', '2004-03-17 10:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(625252, 64691, 318, '<td valign="top">The subject is more interesting than the photograph. :)</td>', 'The subject is more interesting than the photograph. :)', '2004-03-17 10:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(625254, 64405, 17166, '<td valign="top">Worst case of purple fringing I''ve ever seen - you must have shot this with a C-700UZ :)   Very interesting line study.  Might have worked better as a duotone or a B&amp;W</td>', 'Worst case of purple fringing I''ve ever seen - you must have shot this with a C-700UZ :)   Very interesting line study.  Might have worked better as a duotone or a B&W', '2004-03-17 10:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(625257, 64620, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems unsharp and colortones seems strange.  Think its overexposed (trying to lighten up the background shadow?).  Another time of the day should probably been better for this capture or simply let the shadow be dark.  Supose youve been seeing beautifyl green tones but maybe this would have been better B&amp;W.</td>', 'Seems unsharp and colortones seems strange.  Think its overexposed (trying to lighten up the background shadow?).  Another time of the day should probably been better for this capture or simply let the shadow be dark.  Supose youve been seeing beautifyl green tones but maybe this would have been better B&W.', '2004-03-17 10:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(625258, 64761, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great subject for the challenge..wonder how it would have looked in B/W ?</td>', 'Great subject for the challenge..wonder how it would have looked in B/W ?', '2004-03-17 10:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(625259, 64578, 17166, '<td valign="top">Wow - I  would have no idea what this was without reading the title.  Very interesting perspective and use of parallell lines.  Would have made a great entry in the mundane challenge as well.</td>', 'Wow - I  would have no idea what this was without reading the title.  Very interesting perspective and use of parallell lines.  Would have made a great entry in the mundane challenge as well.', '2004-03-17 10:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(625260, 64414, 15919, '<td valign="top">Dont know if this is suposed to be somekind of a joke (dont get offended if not) but I dont find it very creative.</td>', 'Dont know if this is suposed to be somekind of a joke (dont get offended if not) but I dont find it very creative.', '2004-03-17 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(625262, 64728, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  The only criticism I have is the little bit of the label that''s visible in the body cavity - would have been nice if the hole were darker so that you couldn''t see it.  Tough to do under basic editing rules, though.</td>', 'Nicely done.  The only criticism I have is the little bit of the label that''s visible in the body cavity - would have been nice if the hole were darker so that you couldn''t see it.  Tough to do under basic editing rules, though.', '2004-03-17 10:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(625264, 64691, 14603, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen this done in macro..excluding the tabletop?<br/>Might have given it more impact</td>', 'Would like to have seen this done in macro..excluding the tabletop?Might have given it more impact', '2004-03-17 10:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(625268, 64851, 17166, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and an original take on the challenge topic.  Wish it had a bit more depth of field (or, at least had the focus point moved more towards the center) and that the weed in the lower left were cropped out.</td>', 'Nice use of color and an original take on the challenge topic.  Wish it had a bit more depth of field (or, at least had the focus point moved more towards the center) and that the weed in the lower left were cropped out.', '2004-03-17 10:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(625271, 64672, 17166, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and a great example of parallell lines strengthening the composition!</td>', 'Beautiful, and a great example of parallell lines strengthening the composition!', '2004-03-17 10:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
