(625408, 64728, 14614, '<td valign="top">not sure I get your title but I like the shot as presented, could use less of the clare lower center.</td>', 'not sure I get your title but I like the shot as presented, could use less of the clare lower center.', '2004-03-17 11:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(625409, 64761, 18419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors! The road seems a bit shifted to the right at the bottom of the picture, and the the grey shoulder on the left accentuates this (as opposed to the grass on the right).  I like the car in the distance, down the road; it adds some motion to what would otherwise be an overwhelmingly static frame.</td>', 'Beautiful colors! The road seems a bit shifted to the right at the bottom of the picture, and the the grey shoulder on the left accentuates this (as opposed to the grass on the right).  I like the car in the distance, down the road; it adds some motion to what would otherwise be an overwhelmingly static frame.', '2004-03-17 11:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(625411, 64824, 10785, '<td valign="top">I voted this low and here are my reasons:<br/> <br/>Bad points:<br/> <br/>The strength of the photo is the leading lines of the stars to the heart shaped jewelry. These are not parallel, they are an array.<br/> <br/>The subject is rather uninteresting. I can see you may be practicing jewelry photography, in which case the background should be brighter, maybe white, and the subject should be spotlighted IMO.<br/> <br/>Good Points:<br/> <br/>Patriotism +1<br/>The lighting is even.<br/>Sharpness and clarity are good.</td>', 'I voted this low and here are my reasons: Bad points: The strength of the photo is the leading lines of the stars to the heart shaped jewelry. These are not parallel, they are an array. The subject is rather uninteresting. I can see you may be practicing jewelry photography, in which case the background should be brighter, maybe white, and the subject should be spotlighted IMO. Good Points: Patriotism +1The lighting is even.Sharpness and clarity are good.', '2004-03-17 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(625413, 64536, 15751, '<td valign="top">This is a very highly photographed subject.  I think you have taken an angle that is more interesting than usual though!  A few criticisms: I with the horizon and all the lines were square with the framing, perhaps some rotational adjustment in photoshop could improve this.  The photo is also quite gray and flat.  Some level and contrast adjustment would fix this up ina jiffy or maybe using a yellow contrast filter if you planned to have a b&amp;w image.  Otherwise a very strong image.</td>', 'This is a very highly photographed subject.  I think you have taken an angle that is more interesting than usual though!  A few criticisms: I with the horizon and all the lines were square with the framing, perhaps some rotational adjustment in photoshop could improve this.  The photo is also quite gray and flat.  Some level and contrast adjustment would fix this up ina jiffy or maybe using a yellow contrast filter if you planned to have a b&w image.  Otherwise a very strong image.', '2004-03-17 11:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(625414, 64572, 18419, '<td valign="top">Brings out the coldness of the metal handrails very nicely; both in form and color.</td>', 'Brings out the coldness of the metal handrails very nicely; both in form and color.', '2004-03-17 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(625415, 64966, 16106, '<td valign="top">lovely colors in the building but the lack of interest and amount of space put into the driveway hurts this shot.</td>', 'lovely colors in the building but the lack of interest and amount of space put into the driveway hurts this shot.', '2004-03-17 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(625417, 64758, 14614, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this one but I''m not finding how you''ve seen the parallel lines here (feel free to pm me to help out here.  If I have to guess I''d say the drums are your parallel as they are what''s in the title.)</td>', 'I really want to like this one but I''m not finding how you''ve seen the parallel lines here (feel free to pm me to help out here.  If I have to guess I''d say the drums are your parallel as they are what''s in the title.)', '2004-03-17 11:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(625418, 64931, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like the creative approach (haven''t see another like it yet)</td>', 'really like the creative approach (haven''t see another like it yet)', '2004-03-17 11:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(625420, 64856, 14614, '<td valign="top">innovative pov and good use of dof.  muted palette accentuates the lines.  nicely done</td>', 'innovative pov and good use of dof.  muted palette accentuates the lines.  nicely done', '2004-03-17 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(625424, 64676, 18219, '<td valign="top">I like the picture a lot and I like the thinking behind it.<br/>That should score more points for not being a run of the mill picture.<br/>But I don''t think it fits in with what they wanted for the challenge.<br/>And I think that is what should more points should be given for.<br/>Sorry.<br/></td>', 'I like the picture a lot and I like the thinking behind it.That should score more points for not being a run of the mill picture.But I don''t think it fits in with what they wanted for the challenge.And I think that is what should more points should be given for.Sorry.', '2004-03-17 11:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(625425, 64674, 14608, '<td valign="top">love colors, great composition</td>', 'love colors, great composition', '2004-03-17 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(625428, 64197, 10785, '<td valign="top">Your composition is good.<br/>The overall focus is poor, even though your tried to focus in on the parallel lines.<br/>I would like to see the focus reversed here (on the deer) since you call attention to beauty in your title.<br/>The picture could be bigger overall.<br/>Misspelled title, probably a typo you didn''t catch before submittal.</td>', 'Your composition is good.The overall focus is poor, even though your tried to focus in on the parallel lines.I would like to see the focus reversed here (on the deer) since you call attention to beauty in your title.The picture could be bigger overall.Misspelled title, probably a typo you didn''t catch before submittal.', '2004-03-17 11:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(625429, 64397, 14614, '<td valign="top">creative idea - background (baseboard) detracts as I find that parallel line breaks up your image and draws my attentin from the subject</td>', 'creative idea - background (baseboard) detracts as I find that parallel line breaks up your image and draws my attentin from the subject', '2004-03-17 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(625431, 64542, 18219, '<td valign="top">I like it!</td>', 'I like it!', '2004-03-17 11:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(625434, 64909, 16106, '<td valign="top">Are those oval pencils? I think you have over distorted this.</td>', 'Are those oval pencils? I think you have over distorted this.', '2004-03-17 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(625435, 64954, 18219, '<td valign="top">The shadows of the rivets(?) are good, yet I think they detract from the picture.<br/>As does the blue in the upper right.</td>', 'The shadows of the rivets(?) are good, yet I think they detract from the picture.As does the blue in the upper right.', '2004-03-17 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(625436, 64754, 14614, '<td valign="top">border really compliments your efforts on composition.</td>', 'border really compliments your efforts on composition.', '2004-03-17 11:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(625437, 64395, 18219, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.<br/>At first I was only looking at the tiles being the parallel lines, but then I realized that the folds of the snow are also parallel.<br/>Well almost parallel!<br/>Overall a verygood picture</td>', 'Nice picture.At first I was only looking at the tiles being the parallel lines, but then I realized that the folds of the snow are also parallel.Well almost parallel!Overall a verygood picture', '2004-03-17 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(625439, 64832, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish the barn was in better focus. good subject, nice framing.</td>', 'I wish the barn was in better focus. good subject, nice framing.', '2004-03-17 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(625440, 64882, 17166, '<td valign="top">Really great idea and composition.  Works well as B&amp;W.  Some sort of diffuser might help with the glare and blown-out highlights on the CDs.</td>', 'Really great idea and composition.  Works well as B&W.  Some sort of diffuser might help with the glare and blown-out highlights on the CDs.', '2004-03-17 11:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(625442, 64728, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good guitar shot. That glare spot which is front and center is not good. I wish I could say how to contend with that. I need to learn myself and will come back to see other comments.</td>', 'This is a good guitar shot. That glare spot which is front and center is not good. I wish I could say how to contend with that. I need to learn myself and will come back to see other comments.', '2004-03-17 11:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(625446, 64722, 16106, '<td valign="top">Too much middle grey. 80 % of the image is within two zones. Very nice subject matter and composition, good POV. I wish it was left in color or more contrast was used in the conversion.</td>', 'Too much middle grey. 80 % of the image is within two zones. Very nice subject matter and composition, good POV. I wish it was left in color or more contrast was used in the conversion.', '2004-03-17 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(625448, 65024, 18419, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture! Perhaps could''ve used the lighting to highlight the forward ''bars'' vs. the ones to the back for a more literal picture; though the weird 2D/3D effect going on might have been the intent!</td>', 'Excellent picture! Perhaps could''ve used the lighting to highlight the forward ''bars'' vs. the ones to the back for a more literal picture; though the weird 2D/3D effect going on might have been the intent!', '2004-03-17 12:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(625451, 64674, 18219, '<td valign="top">THE COLORS DON''T LOOK RIGHT.</td>', 'THE COLORS DON''T LOOK RIGHT.', '2004-03-17 12:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(625453, 64579, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good reflection, weak parallel.</td>', 'Good reflection, weak parallel.', '2004-03-17 12:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(625458, 64765, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the ocean is sort of boring in this shot, while the cross bracing is interesting. If you had taken the shot lower, would the waves have looked bigger and shown more of the peir?</td>', 'Nice idea but the ocean is sort of boring in this shot, while the cross bracing is interesting. If you had taken the shot lower, would the waves have looked bigger and shown more of the peir?', '2004-03-17 12:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(625460, 64951, 18419, '<td valign="top">Nice organization of the picture.  The near-most plants are obscured by the shadow, though, making it more dreary than the brighter plant in the upper left (and compared to the fence, which is evenly lit throughout).</td>', 'Nice organization of the picture.  The near-most plants are obscured by the shadow, though, making it more dreary than the brighter plant in the upper left (and compared to the fence, which is evenly lit throughout).', '2004-03-17 12:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(625461, 64691, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. My only suggestion would be to try something from a slightly different angle - or crop in closer. However, overall it''s an amazing shot. good luck!!</td>', 'I really like this one. My only suggestion would be to try something from a slightly different angle - or crop in closer. However, overall it''s an amazing shot. good luck!!', '2004-03-17 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(625463, 64887, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and I''ll be curious to find out the subject when the challenge is over. I love the colours and especially the compositoin. I''m givig it a 10.</td>', 'I love this shot and I''ll be curious to find out the subject when the challenge is over. I love the colours and especially the compositoin. I''m givig it a 10.', '2004-03-17 12:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(625465, 64930, 18177, '<td valign="top">Really like the colours in this picture</td>', 'Really like the colours in this picture', '2004-03-17 12:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(625467, 64484, 15207, '<td valign="top">I really love this one - esp. with the bird flying by. Good luck!</td>', 'I really love this one - esp. with the bird flying by. Good luck!', '2004-03-17 12:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(625469, 64487, 15207, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the tones, the layers and the lighting. Great composition. I''m giving it a 10.</td>', 'I absolutely love the tones, the layers and the lighting. Great composition. I''m giving it a 10.', '2004-03-17 12:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(625472, 64818, 15207, '<td valign="top">Hey... great shot. I think you may take home a ribbon for this one. Good luck!</td>', 'Hey... great shot. I think you may take home a ribbon for this one. Good luck!', '2004-03-17 12:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(625473, 64421, 15207, '<td valign="top">What a great optical illusion. I really like all the textures and the rich colours. Good luck!</td>', 'What a great optical illusion. I really like all the textures and the rich colours. Good luck!', '2004-03-17 12:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(625474, 64342, 18419, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus; the brige is sharp throughout and the city is in soft relief. Lovely colors.  I don''t know what the stone in the bottom left does for the picture though; it''s not regular enough to provide a sense of scale, but it does anchor that area.</td>', 'Excellent focus; the brige is sharp throughout and the city is in soft relief. Lovely colors.  I don''t know what the stone in the bottom left does for the picture though; it''s not regular enough to provide a sense of scale, but it does anchor that area.', '2004-03-17 12:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(625476, 64161, 15207, '<td valign="top">Oh... I wish I''d thought of this. A great idea for this challenge, plus it''s well composed and the lighting is perfect. Good luck!</td>', 'Oh... I wish I''d thought of this. A great idea for this challenge, plus it''s well composed and the lighting is perfect. Good luck!', '2004-03-17 12:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(625480, 64851, 18419, '<td valign="top">Good use of thirds with respect to the depth of field in focus.</td>', 'Good use of thirds with respect to the depth of field in focus.', '2004-03-17 12:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(625481, 64862, 18219, '<td valign="top">The man spoils it for me.<br/>Sorry.</td>', 'The man spoils it for me.Sorry.', '2004-03-17 12:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(625483, 64814, 4591, '<td valign="top">NICE!  I love it - there is a lot of mood, and the composition seems pretty balanced.</td>', 'NICE!  I love it - there is a lot of mood, and the composition seems pretty balanced.', '2004-03-17 12:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(625484, 64337, 18177, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot!</td>', 'fantastic shot!', '2004-03-17 12:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(625486, 64759, 18219, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.</td>', 'Great perspective.', '2004-03-17 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(625487, 64740, 4591, '<td valign="top">The leading lines work here, and the contrast in the pic looks great.  I like.</td>', 'The leading lines work here, and the contrast in the pic looks great.  I like.', '2004-03-17 12:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(625488, 64741, 4591, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds used... the lines are parallel... and the contrast looks good.  It still seems to be missing something... maybe a complete conversion to black and white?  Is it too gray?</td>', 'Rule of thirds used... the lines are parallel... and the contrast looks good.  It still seems to be missing something... maybe a complete conversion to black and white?  Is it too gray?', '2004-03-17 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(625490, 64343, 4591, '<td valign="top">Nice lines... but is it too dead-center?</td>', 'Nice lines... but is it too dead-center?', '2004-03-17 12:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(625491, 64480, 4591, '<td valign="top">Cool composition... but it seems a little "flat" almost like there really aren''t any curves.</td>', 'Cool composition... but it seems a little "flat" almost like there really aren''t any curves.', '2004-03-17 12:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(625492, 64398, 18419, '<td valign="top">Nice.  A bit dark across the bottom, esp. the leftmost string and the white face between the string and the black area to the left.</td>', 'Nice.  A bit dark across the bottom, esp. the leftmost string and the white face between the string and the black area to the left.', '2004-03-17 12:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(625494, 64518, 18219, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge!</td>', 'fits the challenge!', '2004-03-17 12:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(625495, 65001, 4591, '<td valign="top">Nice concept... but the blown highliights are a little distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice concept... but the blown highliights are a little distracting to me.', '2004-03-17 12:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(625496, 64735, 18219, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white image.</td>', 'Nice black and white image.', '2004-03-17 12:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(625497, 64282, 4591, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the DOF - and the color looks pleasing.  Pretty cool shot.  Maybe could have expanded the pens to the edges of both sides?</td>', 'I LOVE the DOF - and the color looks pleasing.  Pretty cool shot.  Maybe could have expanded the pens to the edges of both sides?', '2004-03-17 12:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(625498, 64656, 18219, '<td valign="top">A bit more snow on the ground would have made it better for me, but I guess you aren''t God and couldn''t do much about it.<br/>Nice image though.</td>', 'A bit more snow on the ground would have made it better for me, but I guess you aren''t God and couldn''t do much about it.Nice image though.', '2004-03-17 12:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(625501, 64344, 4591, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The wood looks worn and the DOF helps that classic look.</td>', 'I like it.  The wood looks worn and the DOF helps that classic look.', '2004-03-17 12:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(625502, 64333, 4591, '<td valign="top">Cool... nice job setting this one p.  I''d like to see it in black and white...</td>', 'Cool... nice job setting this one p.  I''d like to see it in black and white...', '2004-03-17 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(625504, 64638, 4591, '<td valign="top">Cool composition!  How does it look in black and white?  I would love to see a great contrast black and white of this one.</td>', 'Cool composition!  How does it look in black and white?  I would love to see a great contrast black and white of this one.', '2004-03-17 12:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(625505, 64484, 749, '<td valign="top">I remember you taking this shot, and Kavey shouting about the bird :o) Coincidentally, this is the same building as the one in my entry! Good shot overall, but might have benefitted from a bit more postprocessing, esp focus and levels (the bird is a bit blurred, and the colours could be a tad richer).</td>', 'I remember you taking this shot, and Kavey shouting about the bird :o) Coincidentally, this is the same building as the one in my entry! Good shot overall, but might have benefitted from a bit more postprocessing, esp focus and levels (the bird is a bit blurred, and the colours could be a tad richer).', '2004-03-17 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(625506, 64975, 4591, '<td valign="top">A pleasing, nice shot.</td>', 'A pleasing, nice shot.', '2004-03-17 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(625509, 64671, 18419, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Shame that the sunlight/shadows didn''t make it all the way to the top left corner.</td>', 'Very nice.  Shame that the sunlight/shadows didn''t make it all the way to the top left corner.', '2004-03-17 12:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(625510, 64851, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish the focal point had been more in the middle of the shot rather than at the very edge of the photo.</td>', 'I wish the focal point had been more in the middle of the shot rather than at the very edge of the photo.', '2004-03-17 12:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(625511, 64683, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very creative was of getting parralel lines in the picture.</td>', 'Very creative was of getting parralel lines in the picture.', '2004-03-17 12:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(625512, 64814, 18485, '<td valign="top">wonderful meeting of challenge and well executed photo.  i love the human element here--makes all the difference.</td>', 'wonderful meeting of challenge and well executed photo.  i love the human element here--makes all the difference.', '2004-03-17 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(625514, 64206, 18485, '<td valign="top">unusual and interesting meeting of challenge.  the overexposed aspect might have deterred but in this photo, it is clearly an asset.</td>', 'unusual and interesting meeting of challenge.  the overexposed aspect might have deterred but in this photo, it is clearly an asset.', '2004-03-17 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(625517, 65015, 18485, '<td valign="top">this is great; meets challenge and i''m sure was challenging to compose...that''s a lot of nickles!</td>', 'this is great; meets challenge and i''m sure was challenging to compose...that''s a lot of nickles!', '2004-03-17 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(625518, 64861, 18419, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame that the oncomming white lights glare around the vertical bars; it sort of chips away at the edges of the bars and undermines the clean lines (as on the right). But a very good photo!</td>', 'It''s a shame that the oncomming white lights glare around the vertical bars; it sort of chips away at the edges of the bars and undermines the clean lines (as on the right). But a very good photo!', '2004-03-17 12:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(625519, 64700, 18485, '<td valign="top">well done.  great shot--the shadow, the color, the composition.  it''s all good.</td>', 'well done.  great shot--the shadow, the color, the composition.  it''s all good.', '2004-03-17 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(625520, 64725, 7291, '<td valign="top">You just know a winner when you see one.  Great picture, great angle, and use of b&amp;w.</td>', 'You just know a winner when you see one.  Great picture, great angle, and use of b&w.', '2004-03-17 12:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(625523, 65015, 15342, '<td valign="top">I like this one! I give a 7. Would''ve been an 8 if the coins had been more aligned(especially the fifth one in the front row) and surely a 10 if the heads had all been upright the same.</td>', 'I like this one! I give a 7. Would''ve been an 8 if the coins had been more aligned(especially the fifth one in the front row) and surely a 10 if the heads had all been upright the same.', '2004-03-17 12:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(625524, 64867, 10634, '<td valign="top">The child detracts from this shot... 5</td>', 'The child detracts from this shot... 5', '2004-03-17 12:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(625525, 64029, 16106, '<td valign="top">the image is out of focus on my screen, does it look focused on yours?</td>', 'the image is out of focus on my screen, does it look focused on yours?', '2004-03-17 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(625528, 64879, 18419, '<td valign="top">The open window anchors the picture beautifully.</td>', 'The open window anchors the picture beautifully.', '2004-03-17 12:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(625531, 64759, 12448, '<td valign="top">St. Louis Arch or something similar I''m guessing?  Very creative, love the flow, looks great but could just a bit more contrast for my taste.    An 8</td>', 'St. Louis Arch or something similar I''m guessing?  Very creative, love the flow, looks great but could just a bit more contrast for my taste.    An 8', '2004-03-17 12:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(625537, 64992, 18331, '<td valign="top">Comment deleted.</td>', 'Comment deleted.', '2004-03-17 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(625541, 64030, 10634, '<td valign="top">The sun glare ruins this photo for me... 5</td>', 'The sun glare ruins this photo for me... 5', '2004-03-17 12:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(625543, 64817, 18419, '<td valign="top">A bit stark and texture-free for my tastes.</td>', 'A bit stark and texture-free for my tastes.', '2004-03-17 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(625547, 64394, 14614, '<td valign="top">thoughtfully composed</td>', 'thoughtfully composed', '2004-03-17 12:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(625548, 64970, 18419, '<td valign="top">Black and white was a good choice.  It''s too bad the lights in the bottom center undermine the flow of brightness from top right to bottom left.</td>', 'Black and white was a good choice.  It''s too bad the lights in the bottom center undermine the flow of brightness from top right to bottom left.', '2004-03-17 12:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(625550, 64989, 16965, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect!</td>', 'Very nice effect!', '2004-03-17 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(625551, 65033, 14614, '<td valign="top">gave you an extra point for the creative title ;)</td>', 'gave you an extra point for the creative title ;)', '2004-03-17 12:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(625552, 64694, 18419, '<td valign="top">Very strong contrast beteen nature and the gate, lovely colors.</td>', 'Very strong contrast beteen nature and the gate, lovely colors.', '2004-03-17 12:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(625556, 64553, 16957, '<td valign="top">Spelling!</td>', 'Spelling!', '2004-03-17 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(625559, 64322, 14614, '<td valign="top">creative take on the theme</td>', 'creative take on the theme', '2004-03-17 12:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(625562, 64620, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very good choice of subject. Lighting a bit harsh.</td>', 'Very good choice of subject. Lighting a bit harsh.', '2004-03-17 12:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(625567, 64400, 16965, '<td valign="top">more curvy than Parallel; lotta lines though</td>', 'more curvy than Parallel; lotta lines though', '2004-03-17 12:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(625568, 64869, 18419, '<td valign="top">Very very strong picture.</td>', 'Very very strong picture.', '2004-03-17 12:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
