(625577, 64861, 15919, '<td valign="top">I predicted that it would be lot of thous in this challenge but there seems not.  This one seems very well performed, clean and sharp and no overbrightened spots as can easily happend in such long exposures.  I find the bars in the forground a litle distracting (though the sure represents parallel lines) and would have like the image better without them.</td>', 'I predicted that it would be lot of thous in this challenge but there seems not.  This one seems very well performed, clean and sharp and no overbrightened spots as can easily happend in such long exposures.  I find the bars in the forground a litle distracting (though the sure represents parallel lines) and would have like the image better without them.', '2004-03-17 13:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(625582, 64908, 15919, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much although it seems a litle unsharp and grainy, suits the subject.  Expecially like how in the begining it takes up all the frame but ends in a small point.  Have you tried it B&amp;W.  Think it might be still better that way and then maybe litle more contrast.</td>', 'I like this one very much although it seems a litle unsharp and grainy, suits the subject.  Expecially like how in the begining it takes up all the frame but ends in a small point.  Have you tried it B&W.  Think it might be still better that way and then maybe litle more contrast.', '2004-03-17 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
