(625747, 64458, 7970, '<td valign="top">Excellent !!! .  The picture speaks for itself portraying the beautiful &amp; intelligent utilization of parallel lines in architecture. Smart idea and great capture indeed.</td>', 'Excellent !!! .  The picture speaks for itself portraying the beautiful & intelligent utilization of parallel lines in architecture. Smart idea and great capture indeed.', '2004-03-17 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(625748, 64029, 18257, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit out of focus</td>', 'It''s a bit out of focus', '2004-03-17 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(625749, 64123, 18485, '<td valign="top">well executed....</td>', 'well executed....', '2004-03-17 14:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(625752, 64188, 18257, '<td valign="top">It''s not exactly the challenge''s topic but the pic'' is nice</td>', 'It''s not exactly the challenge''s topic but the pic'' is nice', '2004-03-17 14:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(625753, 64826, 16420, '<td valign="top">Hello. I like what you are trying to do with this image. I almost wonder if you should increase the image size. I find images that are smaller in dimension tend to not do as well in challenges. Also, I recently read that at least something in the image should be sharp and in focus. You may want to try a tripod. But this is a good choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Hello. I like what you are trying to do with this image. I almost wonder if you should increase the image size. I find images that are smaller in dimension tend to not do as well in challenges. Also, I recently read that at least something in the image should be sharp and in focus. You may want to try a tripod. But this is a good choice for this challenge.', '2004-03-17 14:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(625754, 64792, 18257, '<td valign="top">Nice concept</td>', 'Nice concept', '2004-03-17 14:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
