(625840, 64875, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a shot that USED parallel lines in the shot instead of a shot of parallel lines. Nice color balance and crisp edges. While toothbrushes do not make great art(IMHO), this is a very artfull shot.</td>', 'Nice to see a shot that USED parallel lines in the shot instead of a shot of parallel lines. Nice color balance and crisp edges. While toothbrushes do not make great art(IMHO), this is a very artfull shot.', '2004-03-17 15:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
