(626152, 64487, 656, '<td valign="top">I like looking through the out of focus, close up frame, and it certainly meets the challenge.  Often I see shots like this and feel it is a stage, just waiting on the subject to arrive - this feels somewhat like that too - a person, some detail that would lift this scene to a more visually interesting level.  The scene is well set...</td>', 'I like looking through the out of focus, close up frame, and it certainly meets the challenge.  Often I see shots like this and feel it is a stage, just waiting on the subject to arrive - this feels somewhat like that too - a person, some detail that would lift this scene to a more visually interesting level.  The scene is well set...', '2004-03-17 17:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
