(626193, 64983, 3087, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the climber - a great focal point - though seems a little soft in focus. Beautiful rich sky colour and cloud texture.</td>', 'I almost missed the climber - a great focal point - though seems a little soft in focus. Beautiful rich sky colour and cloud texture.', '2004-03-17 17:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
