(626277, 64989, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this - the way the old cobbles look against the gleaming metal - and the way you have only the bottom half of someone, all in black. Very enigmatic.</td>', 'I like this - the way the old cobbles look against the gleaming metal - and the way you have only the bottom half of someone, all in black. Very enigmatic.', '2004-03-17 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
