(626304, 64989, 18259, '<td valign="top">Best of the challenge, IMHO  The lines are obvious and parallel, but only part of the overall image.  The figure adds a different dimension, particularly with the chosen crop - an element of mystery perhaps? Where is he, why is he moving away?  Technically bang on, contrast excellent from the deep black of the figure to the completely white reflecte rails.  Good luck!</td>', 'Best of the challenge, IMHO  The lines are obvious and parallel, but only part of the overall image.  The figure adds a different dimension, particularly with the chosen crop - an element of mystery perhaps? Where is he, why is he moving away?  Technically bang on, contrast excellent from the deep black of the figure to the completely white reflecte rails.  Good luck!', '2004-03-17 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
