(626968, 64480, 12194, '<td valign="top">nice composition, I am not sure about the parallel curves though, but nice capture! 7</td>', 'nice composition, I am not sure about the parallel curves though, but nice capture! 7', '2004-03-18 05:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(626969, 64730, 12194, '<td valign="top">the hands are a little disturbing, on the other hand, they make a central poitn of the image...</td>', 'the hands are a little disturbing, on the other hand, they make a central poitn of the image...', '2004-03-18 05:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(626970, 64824, 9232, '<td valign="top">I understand artistic interpretation and like to "vote up" stuff that might seem to not fit the challenge but where are the parallel lines in this composition?  The lines on the flag?  If so then they are a very small piece of this and the submission suffers for it.  I like the use of negative space but if the flag lines are supposed to be your parallels then they don''t seem to create the strength of the whole photo, they seem an afterthought.  It is a fairly good photo although I''d move the subject out from the background as a shadow is visible behind and below the stars as well as the eagle.  Perhaps trying this without the starfall item attached to the heart-shaped piece would render a strong result.</td>', 'I understand artistic interpretation and like to "vote up" stuff that might seem to not fit the challenge but where are the parallel lines in this composition?  The lines on the flag?  If so then they are a very small piece of this and the submission suffers for it.  I like the use of negative space but if the flag lines are supposed to be your parallels then they don''t seem to create the strength of the whole photo, they seem an afterthought.  It is a fairly good photo although I''d move the subject out from the background as a shadow is visible behind and below the stars as well as the eagle.  Perhaps trying this without the starfall item attached to the heart-shaped piece would render a strong result.', '2004-03-18 05:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(626971, 64342, 12194, '<td valign="top">very nice, i think it should place high!! The blues in the picture are amazing!!! 10</td>', 'very nice, i think it should place high!! The blues in the picture are amazing!!! 10', '2004-03-18 05:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(626972, 64867, 18552, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this shot would have been more effective without any people.  The parallel lines in the fence would made more of a statement without the boy.</td>', 'Perhaps this shot would have been more effective without any people.  The parallel lines in the fence would made more of a statement without the boy.', '2004-03-18 05:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(626973, 64571, 12194, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a great image, i bet it will be in top 10!! 10</td>', 'Wow! This is a great image, i bet it will be in top 10!! 10', '2004-03-18 05:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(626974, 64676, 9232, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture of the horses.  I love the texture you got here.  I think that I can see how you wanted the parallel to be defined with the two heads  and two tails and that I can see but it doesn''t seem to fit the "lines" portion.  I ike the capture but choose to vote it an average score.  Perhaps I''m just missing the lines you wanted to bring out but after looking at it for a little while the closest thing I see is the right front shoulder of the horse in the FG and the right rear leg of the horse in the BG.  Those muscle lines appear to be similar but they definitely don''t seem to provide the strength of this photo.  Having said that, I think this is a lovely capture that I''d love to print and hang on my wall if I''d taken it.  It has an organic and natural feel to it and I love the duotone effect you put on it.  Just don''t like it too much for the challenge.</td>', 'Gorgeous capture of the horses.  I love the texture you got here.  I think that I can see how you wanted the parallel to be defined with the two heads  and two tails and that I can see but it doesn''t seem to fit the "lines" portion.  I ike the capture but choose to vote it an average score.  Perhaps I''m just missing the lines you wanted to bring out but after looking at it for a little while the closest thing I see is the right front shoulder of the horse in the FG and the right rear leg of the horse in the BG.  Those muscle lines appear to be similar but they definitely don''t seem to provide the strength of this photo.  Having said that, I think this is a lovely capture that I''d love to print and hang on my wall if I''d taken it.  It has an organic and natural feel to it and I love the duotone effect you put on it.  Just don''t like it too much for the challenge.', '2004-03-18 05:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(626975, 65010, 10739, '<td valign="top">nice, nice composition. However, not the one that better fits the challenge.</td>', 'nice, nice composition. However, not the one that better fits the challenge.', '2004-03-18 05:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(626978, 64455, 17551, '<td valign="top">i like the originality</td>', 'i like the originality', '2004-03-18 06:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(626979, 64400, 17551, '<td valign="top">cool reflection</td>', 'cool reflection', '2004-03-18 06:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(626988, 64674, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Litle more croping at the bottom.  Maybe litle to warmly WB.  Othervise, very good.</td>', 'Nice image.  Litle more croping at the bottom.  Maybe litle to warmly WB.  Othervise, very good.', '2004-03-18 06:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(626991, 64951, 15919, '<td valign="top">Maybe litle underexposed and lack of colorsaturation.  If I were you I would go closer to the fence, decrase the apperturue to minimum and focus on one rim and try to blurr out the ones farthest away.  All the same this is an OK imaga of my opinion.</td>', 'Maybe litle underexposed and lack of colorsaturation.  If I were you I would go closer to the fence, decrase the apperturue to minimum and focus on one rim and try to blurr out the ones farthest away.  All the same this is an OK imaga of my opinion.', '2004-03-18 06:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(626993, 64696, 15420, '<td valign="top">The clarity is not that great for a D100, nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'The clarity is not that great for a D100, nice take on the challenge.', '2004-03-18 06:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(626995, 64337, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field.  I would have liked to see more lines just to create less of a focus on the binder.</td>', 'Nice depth of field.  I would have liked to see more lines just to create less of a focus on the binder.', '2004-03-18 06:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(626996, 64341, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice diea, is it a guy or girl?</td>', 'Nice diea, is it a guy or girl?', '2004-03-18 06:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(626998, 65016, 15420, '<td valign="top">Well composed.  The black and white really highlights the stacks as the central feature.  Well done.</td>', 'Well composed.  The black and white really highlights the stacks as the central feature.  Well done.', '2004-03-18 06:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(626999, 64923, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composition.  Its a shame the photo is so small.</td>', 'Great idea and composition.  Its a shame the photo is so small.', '2004-03-18 06:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(627000, 64666, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  A little confusing with the vegetation in the background.    Unusual title for the shot, but not bad</td>', 'Nice photo.  A little confusing with the vegetation in the background.    Unusual title for the shot, but not bad', '2004-03-18 06:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
