(627003, 64395, 15420, '<td valign="top">What a refreshing photo, I hope people dont get out their rulers for this one, as its borderline parallel :D   Nice composition.</td>', 'What a refreshing photo, I hope people dont get out their rulers for this one, as its borderline parallel :D   Nice composition.', '2004-03-18 06:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(627005, 64978, 15420, '<td valign="top">I dunno why, but I just get a feeling of ''Lack of focus'' in this shot.  Nice idea though</td>', 'I dunno why, but I just get a feeling of ''Lack of focus'' in this shot.  Nice idea though', '2004-03-18 06:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(627006, 64279, 15420, '<td valign="top">Well done, you''ve addressed the Challenge well.  An interesting shot, but I want to see more of the river : )</td>', 'Well done, you''ve addressed the Challenge well.  An interesting shot, but I want to see more of the river : )', '2004-03-18 06:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(627008, 64282, 15420, '<td valign="top">The focus doesn''t seem quite there.  Maybe its the lighting, but the composition seems ''soft''.   Great idea and good use of shadows.</td>', 'The focus doesn''t seem quite there.  Maybe its the lighting, but the composition seems ''soft''.   Great idea and good use of shadows.', '2004-03-18 06:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(627009, 64816, 15420, '<td valign="top">Very clear photo. Fair composition.  Not a great deal of originality.</td>', 'Very clear photo. Fair composition.  Not a great deal of originality.', '2004-03-18 06:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(627011, 64030, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Interesting use of sepia/desaturation.  The sun does take some of parallel line''s thunder though.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Interesting use of sepia/desaturation.  The sun does take some of parallel line''s thunder though.', '2004-03-18 06:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(627012, 64793, 15420, '<td valign="top">Very literal :)  I like it.  Good depth of field.</td>', 'Very literal :)  I like it.  Good depth of field.', '2004-03-18 06:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(627014, 64747, 15420, '<td valign="top">I bet your kicking yourself for that little black smudge near the top pencil :D<br/>Great idea though.  The lighting on the pencils could be increased slightly.</td>', 'I bet your kicking yourself for that little black smudge near the top pencil :DGreat idea though.  The lighting on the pencils could be increased slightly.', '2004-03-18 06:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(627016, 64456, 7743, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.   For me the upper left corner of an image always provides the most impact so putting the end of the leaf in that quadrant would greatly improve the impact of your image.<br/> <br/>The parallel lines in your image are fairly weak though present..<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great depth of field.   For me the upper left corner of an image always provides the most impact so putting the end of the leaf in that quadrant would greatly improve the impact of your image. The parallel lines in your image are fairly weak though present.. ', '2004-03-18 06:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(627018, 64471, 15420, '<td valign="top">Going up.  It looks like he''s wearing a baseball cap.  Nice photo, and good to see a central focus point to complete the image (the guy)</td>', 'Going up.  It looks like he''s wearing a baseball cap.  Nice photo, and good to see a central focus point to complete the image (the guy)', '2004-03-18 06:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(627022, 64761, 18213, '<td valign="top">This one is gonna make it in top 5.....  Maby the parallel is not strong enough for many people but the photo itself is beautiful....    8</td>', 'This one is gonna make it in top 5.....  Maby the parallel is not strong enough for many people but the photo itself is beautiful....    8', '2004-03-18 07:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(627024, 64584, 15420, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and well composed.  Its refreshing to see someone find something in nature that portrays this challenge requirement.</td>', 'Well thought out and well composed.  Its refreshing to see someone find something in nature that portrays this challenge requirement.', '2004-03-18 07:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(627025, 64763, 15420, '<td valign="top">... Maybe the feathers on the wings...?  Nice photo overall, but Im the parallel lines aren''t JUMPING out at me.</td>', '... Maybe the feathers on the wings...?  Nice photo overall, but Im the parallel lines aren''t JUMPING out at me.', '2004-03-18 07:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
