(627047, 64484, 15420, '<td valign="top">Bloody excellent shot!  I''d like to see this in the top 20 (not that I''ve seen all the entries yet).  The bird is a lucky addition to this photograph and the perspective, just MAKES it.  Well done.  8</td>', 'Bloody excellent shot!  I''d like to see this in the top 20 (not that I''ve seen all the entries yet).  The bird is a lucky addition to this photograph and the perspective, just MAKES it.  Well done.  8', '2004-03-18 07:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
