(627454, 64989, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like it, the sepia toning is very nice and I especially like that you have cropped the person above the waist... gives it a feeling of anonymity. (sp?)</td>', 'I really like it, the sepia toning is very nice and I especially like that you have cropped the person above the waist... gives it a feeling of anonymity. (sp?)', '2004-03-18 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
