(627475, 64694, 12131, '<td valign="top">The gate makes a nice frame at the same time.  Nice image beyond.  I really like the landscape.</td>', 'The gate makes a nice frame at the same time.  Nice image beyond.  I really like the landscape.', '2004-03-18 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(627476, 64750, 11486, '<td valign="top">Had this idea myself, but its to much snow around here. Good shot.</td>', 'Had this idea myself, but its to much snow around here. Good shot.', '2004-03-18 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(627478, 64991, 11486, '<td valign="top">Realy like the unusual perspective!</td>', 'Realy like the unusual perspective!', '2004-03-18 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(627479, 64507, 12131, '<td valign="top">That would scare the crud out of me.  Where is that?  Impressive shot.</td>', 'That would scare the crud out of me.  Where is that?  Impressive shot.', '2004-03-18 13:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(627480, 64730, 15919, '<td valign="top">The hands in the middle gives this image a lot.  How about litle more croping and maybe B&amp;W.</td>', 'The hands in the middle gives this image a lot.  How about litle more croping and maybe B&W.', '2004-03-18 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(627482, 64772, 11486, '<td valign="top">Very cool lighting and an interesting compostion. The best so far in this challange!</td>', 'Very cool lighting and an interesting compostion. The best so far in this challange!', '2004-03-18 13:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(627485, 64973, 16715, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture, but i think the strings should be the main point. Croping it a little better would probably make the difference.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture, but i think the strings should be the main point. Croping it a little better would probably make the difference.', '2004-03-18 13:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(627486, 64237, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The colors are nice along with the texture of the waves against the sky.</td>', 'I like this.  The colors are nice along with the texture of the waves against the sky.', '2004-03-18 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(627488, 64447, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the angle is a little awkward.  7</td>', 'I like the subject but the angle is a little awkward.  7', '2004-03-18 13:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(627537, 64267, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but i would have put focus on something other than the underside of the monitor...</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but i would have put focus on something other than the underside of the monitor...', '2004-03-18 14:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(627538, 64130, 11486, '<td valign="top">The lines are there OK, but parallel???</td>', 'The lines are there OK, but parallel???', '2004-03-18 14:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(627540, 65024, 11486, '<td valign="top">very colorfull, but the birds feels slightly unfocused.</td>', 'very colorfull, but the birds feels slightly unfocused.', '2004-03-18 14:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(627542, 65033, 11486, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, considerd somthing similar myself, but could not find an interesting enough angel of view. Also likes the lighting, shadows and focus of this one!</td>', 'Nice idea, considerd somthing similar myself, but could not find an interesting enough angel of view. Also likes the lighting, shadows and focus of this one!', '2004-03-18 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(627544, 64666, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but maybe a different angel of view would be more interesting?</td>', 'Not bad, but maybe a different angel of view would be more interesting?', '2004-03-18 14:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(627546, 64982, 18509, '<td valign="top">minor detail - the border may distract the eye slightly because they are not parallel with the lines in the photograph, however having everything parallel might have made the photograph flat and monotonous. In any case, great picture, the faded tone is really nice</td>', 'minor detail - the border may distract the eye slightly because they are not parallel with the lines in the photograph, however having everything parallel might have made the photograph flat and monotonous. In any case, great picture, the faded tone is really nice', '2004-03-18 14:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(627547, 64342, 11486, '<td valign="top">I lke this one a lot. Slight overexposure of the lights, but the lighting is difficult, and the result is very good anyway.</td>', 'I lke this one a lot. Slight overexposure of the lights, but the lighting is difficult, and the result is very good anyway.', '2004-03-18 14:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(627551, 64611, 18509, '<td valign="top">I like the color, it sets this apart from most of the other railroad shots. I also like the fact that its cloudy and humid. You captured that well with your camera. The naturally diffused light from the clouds helps soften the color of the metal tracks. This makes the other colors more vivid and I think that is what makes this photograph nice. I also loke the height and angle of the photograph. Well done.</td>', 'I like the color, it sets this apart from most of the other railroad shots. I also like the fact that its cloudy and humid. You captured that well with your camera. The naturally diffused light from the clouds helps soften the color of the metal tracks. This makes the other colors more vivid and I think that is what makes this photograph nice. I also loke the height and angle of the photograph. Well done.', '2004-03-18 14:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(627552, 64981, 16595, '<td valign="top">I like it. But maybe lit against a darker background would have made it a bit more appealing</td>', 'I like it. But maybe lit against a darker background would have made it a bit more appealing', '2004-03-18 14:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(627553, 64188, 18509, '<td valign="top">I like the color in the shot. I would have preferred seeing the lines intersect with a level horizon, but thats a minor detail. Did you use white balance to enhance the color, or is that natural? Its probably natural and thats why I like the photograph. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the color in the shot. I would have preferred seeing the lines intersect with a level horizon, but thats a minor detail. Did you use white balance to enhance the color, or is that natural? Its probably natural and thats why I like the photograph. Nicely done.', '2004-03-18 14:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(627558, 64925, 18509, '<td valign="top">The color and sharp focus make this photograph exceptional. I think no border was a good choice. I also like the perspective. Well done.</td>', 'The color and sharp focus make this photograph exceptional. I think no border was a good choice. I also like the perspective. Well done.', '2004-03-18 14:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(627561, 64363, 16595, '<td valign="top">nice perspective. like it</td>', 'nice perspective. like it', '2004-03-18 14:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(627563, 64884, 18509, '<td valign="top">This seems rather uneventful for my taste, but technically very nice. I like how sharp the focus is on the fork, and soft and diffused the background lighting is. In other words good DOF. I also like the color fade from yellow to orange. Nicely done.</td>', 'This seems rather uneventful for my taste, but technically very nice. I like how sharp the focus is on the fork, and soft and diffused the background lighting is. In other words good DOF. I also like the color fade from yellow to orange. Nicely done.', '2004-03-18 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(627564, 64578, 18480, '<td valign="top">Love this shot....it is as if there is a road leading to a black hole in the sky!</td>', 'Love this shot....it is as if there is a road leading to a black hole in the sky!', '2004-03-18 14:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(627565, 64825, 16595, '<td valign="top">Hope you landed safely there''s a parallel oil leak there</td>', 'Hope you landed safely there''s a parallel oil leak there', '2004-03-18 14:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(627566, 64740, 18509, '<td valign="top">The b/w color is what I like about this photograph. This is a very nice location. I would like to see a picture of this without people on the road. The border helps set the tone and color. Nice perspective. Well done.</td>', 'The b/w color is what I like about this photograph. This is a very nice location. I would like to see a picture of this without people on the road. The border helps set the tone and color. Nice perspective. Well done.', '2004-03-18 14:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(627569, 65017, 18509, '<td valign="top">The symmetry of this picture is very interesting. I like how calm the picture is. The smooth undisturbed water and cloudy atmosphere helps that. Nicely done.</td>', 'The symmetry of this picture is very interesting. I like how calm the picture is. The smooth undisturbed water and cloudy atmosphere helps that. Nicely done.', '2004-03-18 14:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(627573, 65017, 18480, '<td valign="top">Great shot....good name for the photo!</td>', 'Great shot....good name for the photo!', '2004-03-18 14:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(627574, 64879, 18509, '<td valign="top">I think your suggesting that the early sunrise is illuminating the small orange portion of the window. If that is the case, well done. This is a very perceptive photograph. That small touch made this photograph very interesting. Well done.</td>', 'I think your suggesting that the early sunrise is illuminating the small orange portion of the window. If that is the case, well done. This is a very perceptive photograph. That small touch made this photograph very interesting. Well done.', '2004-03-18 14:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(627575, 64859, 16499, '<td valign="top">I can not find the sharp one... :-(((</td>', 'I can not find the sharp one... :-(((', '2004-03-18 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(627578, 64700, 16499, '<td valign="top">+10!</td>', '+10!', '2004-03-18 14:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(627584, 64405, 18440, '<td valign="top">Overexposed and uninteresting.</td>', 'Overexposed and uninteresting.', '2004-03-18 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(627587, 64399, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice picture, love the feeling it gives one to look at it. I think it would be even better if it were a bit more clearly focused with a bit more contrast.</td>', 'This is a really nice picture, love the feeling it gives one to look at it. I think it would be even better if it were a bit more clearly focused with a bit more contrast.', '2004-03-18 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(627588, 64880, 16499, '<td valign="top">That is something! I like the moire effect which creates radial lines illusion. Very sharp and clear image!</td>', 'That is something! I like the moire effect which creates radial lines illusion. Very sharp and clear image!', '2004-03-18 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(627589, 64256, 16499, '<td valign="top">Nice object... The shadow and no-focus in the middle of the slab spoil it a little...</td>', 'Nice object... The shadow and no-focus in the middle of the slab spoil it a little...', '2004-03-18 15:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(627590, 65001, 16499, '<td valign="top">Just 5 minutes earlier the shadow border would have been between the hands!</td>', 'Just 5 minutes earlier the shadow border would have been between the hands!', '2004-03-18 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(627592, 64279, 2752, '<td valign="top">simple but good..great use of parellel lines.</td>', 'simple but good..great use of parellel lines.', '2004-03-18 15:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(627593, 64675, 18389, '<td valign="top">The shadows seem to detract from the simplicity of the image.</td>', 'The shadows seem to detract from the simplicity of the image.', '2004-03-18 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(627597, 65010, 16499, '<td valign="top">Is the door knob relevant? Unless you mean the color match...</td>', 'Is the door knob relevant? Unless you mean the color match...', '2004-03-18 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(627598, 64766, 16402, '<td valign="top">Think you''d have gotten more emphasis on the parallel lines (strings) if you had reversed the depth of field with it starting n focus and fading into a blur. This way the emphasis is pretty much on the backdrop.</td>', 'Think you''d have gotten more emphasis on the parallel lines (strings) if you had reversed the depth of field with it starting n focus and fading into a blur. This way the emphasis is pretty much on the backdrop.', '2004-03-18 15:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(627599, 64140, 16402, '<td valign="top">So many that it really becomes a texture.</td>', 'So many that it really becomes a texture.', '2004-03-18 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(627600, 64737, 16402, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective to create an interesting composition.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective to create an interesting composition.', '2004-03-18 15:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(627601, 64686, 18073, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, I find the telegraph poles keep gragging my attention</td>', 'I really like this image, I find the telegraph poles keep gragging my attention', '2004-03-18 15:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(627603, 64521, 18073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but I think it would have worked better with a plain wall</td>', 'Interesting image, but I think it would have worked better with a plain wall', '2004-03-18 15:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(627604, 64728, 16402, '<td valign="top">Highlight is a bit distracting but nice job otherwise.</td>', 'Highlight is a bit distracting but nice job otherwise.', '2004-03-18 15:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(627606, 64861, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I do like this image</td>', 'Nice shot, I do like this image', '2004-03-18 15:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(627608, 64852, 10339, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Looks like you took this looking through a scratched window.</td>', 'Interesting. Looks like you took this looking through a scratched window.', '2004-03-18 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(627610, 65022, 18073, '<td valign="top">I think if you had moved closer and captured more detail of fewer trees the image would have been stronger</td>', 'I think if you had moved closer and captured more detail of fewer trees the image would have been stronger', '2004-03-18 15:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
