(628232, 64414, 16695, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve composed this.  The blue section pleasantly cuts across the corner with its dynamic angling.  The lighting, though, really feels lacking.  It looks like you unravelled this flag, put it on the ground, snapped away a few shots with the flash, and then you were done.  (Some softer lighting and a smoothed out flag would have taken this a lot further, imo)</td>', 'I like the way you''ve composed this.  The blue section pleasantly cuts across the corner with its dynamic angling.  The lighting, though, really feels lacking.  It looks like you unravelled this flag, put it on the ground, snapped away a few shots with the flash, and then you were done.  (Some softer lighting and a smoothed out flag would have taken this a lot further, imo)', '2004-03-19 01:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
