(628242, 64691, 14043, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea and cropping.  Great DOF.  The color does seem too bland though, a boost of contrast might bring out the red in the match heads.</td>', 'Awesome idea and cropping.  Great DOF.  The color does seem too bland though, a boost of contrast might bring out the red in the match heads.', '2004-03-19 01:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(628243, 64745, 14043, '<td valign="top">Great cropping and focus.  I''m not sure how it would come out, but what if you tried desaturating this and having just the blue staircase remain in color?</td>', 'Great cropping and focus.  I''m not sure how it would come out, but what if you tried desaturating this and having just the blue staircase remain in color?', '2004-03-19 01:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(628244, 64747, 14043, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of negative space and color.  I might have liked to have them more to the left or to the right (rule of thirds), but it works great as it is.</td>', 'Awesome use of negative space and color.  I might have liked to have them more to the left or to the right (rule of thirds), but it works great as it is.', '2004-03-19 02:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(628245, 64700, 14043, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The color is fabulous and the use of the curves is superb.  It makes you almost dizzy if you scroll past too fast.  The use of the shadow was a great idea, double the effect.</td>', 'Wow.  The color is fabulous and the use of the curves is superb.  It makes you almost dizzy if you scroll past too fast.  The use of the shadow was a great idea, double the effect.', '2004-03-19 02:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(628246, 64788, 14043, '<td valign="top">Such a great capture.  The DOF is great and the color is wonderfully even.  I really like your use of the border to pull out the grey and continue it, keeping the photo contained within itself.</td>', 'Such a great capture.  The DOF is great and the color is wonderfully even.  I really like your use of the border to pull out the grey and continue it, keeping the photo contained within itself.', '2004-03-19 02:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(628247, 64676, 14043, '<td valign="top">Such wonderful DOF, color choice, and cropping.  I don''t know how you managed it but getting them into the same stance looks beautiful.</td>', 'Such wonderful DOF, color choice, and cropping.  I don''t know how you managed it but getting them into the same stance looks beautiful.', '2004-03-19 02:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(628248, 65019, 14043, '<td valign="top">Sepia tone and DOF are perfect.  The sharpness is amazing and I love the graduated lighting/background as well as the shadows.</td>', 'Sepia tone and DOF are perfect.  The sharpness is amazing and I love the graduated lighting/background as well as the shadows.', '2004-03-19 02:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(628249, 64282, 14043, '<td valign="top">It looks like a product shot!  Lol.  The DOF and blur are wonderful, not to mention the shadows.  Great lighting job.</td>', 'It looks like a product shot!  Lol.  The DOF and blur are wonderful, not to mention the shadows.  Great lighting job.', '2004-03-19 02:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(628250, 64342, 14043, '<td valign="top">So many parallells!  Beautiful cityscape and great use of a tall panoramic style space.  The dusk lighting works perfectly with the street lamps to create the colors.  Awesomely crisp and clear.</td>', 'So many parallells!  Beautiful cityscape and great use of a tall panoramic style space.  The dusk lighting works perfectly with the street lamps to create the colors.  Awesomely crisp and clear.', '2004-03-19 02:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(628254, 65005, 3419, '<td valign="top">If there are any parallel lines in this photo, they are much too subtle for this challenge. You''ll lose marks for that. Nonetheless, composition and exposure are good.</td>', 'If there are any parallel lines in this photo, they are much too subtle for this challenge. You''ll lose marks for that. Nonetheless, composition and exposure are good.', '2004-03-19 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(628257, 64427, 16965, '<td valign="top">a little boring....to static</td>', 'a little boring....to static', '2004-03-19 02:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
