(628802, 64761, 18485, '<td valign="top">great vision of parallels going vertically (road) and horizontally (the lovely landscape).  great realization of the challenge and excellent photography.  (i know it''s picayune but i am a teeny bit distracted by the car (?) in the distance...once i noticed it, it became a thorn in your lovely image.)</td>', 'great vision of parallels going vertically (road) and horizontally (the lovely landscape).  great realization of the challenge and excellent photography.  (i know it''s picayune but i am a teeny bit distracted by the car (?) in the distance...once i noticed it, it became a thorn in your lovely image.)', '2004-03-19 15:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(628806, 64983, 18485, '<td valign="top">love this...i am finding the entries like yours with parallel in nature to be the most compelling, interesting and worthy.  i love the way your parallel lines deconstruct at the top and i like your climber  in red...adds a needed sense of scale (and a nice spark of color).</td>', 'love this...i am finding the entries like yours with parallel in nature to be the most compelling, interesting and worthy.  i love the way your parallel lines deconstruct at the top and i like your climber  in red...adds a needed sense of scale (and a nice spark of color).', '2004-03-19 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
