(628846, 64758, 7291, '<td valign="top">NICE SHOT!!!  I love it.  Unfortunately, I really don''t see much in the way of parallel lines though.  Sure, there are some lines...but not in the way the challenge was supposed to bring out.</td>', 'NICE SHOT!!!  I love it.  Unfortunately, I really don''t see much in the way of parallel lines though.  Sure, there are some lines...but not in the way the challenge was supposed to bring out.', '2004-03-19 16:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
