(628857, 64909, 7291, '<td valign="top">Why do they look so compressed?  Sort of like the final frame in a Chinese Karate film.  I feel that the yellow marker on the right could have been eliminated to create more symmetry.</td>', 'Why do they look so compressed?  Sort of like the final frame in a Chinese Karate film.  I feel that the yellow marker on the right could have been eliminated to create more symmetry.', '2004-03-19 16:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
