(628861, 64444, 15207, '<td valign="top">Great shot. i can see this doing really well on a stock photography site. I really love the blue of the sky - it really balances out this image well. Good luck - 8</td>', 'Great shot. i can see this doing really well on a stock photography site. I really love the blue of the sky - it really balances out this image well. Good luck - 8', '2004-03-19 16:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
