(628866, 65015, 7291, '<td valign="top">You know.....there are very few people on this PLANET that have the patience required to set this up.  I cnosider myself as having allot of patience but just looking at this gives me anxiety.  I commend you.  Oh yeah....nice shot too.</td>', 'You know.....there are very few people on this PLANET that have the patience required to set this up.  I cnosider myself as having allot of patience but just looking at this gives me anxiety.  I commend you.  Oh yeah....nice shot too.', '2004-03-19 16:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(628867, 64817, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like that the dark shadows aren''t exactly even. It really adds to the overall composition - 7</td>', 'I like that the dark shadows aren''t exactly even. It really adds to the overall composition - 7', '2004-03-19 16:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(628868, 64197, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the concept here. I''m not sure if this was originally a lot bigger and you cropped a small piece of the image or not. It''s a bit grainy with lots of image noise. It also somehow doesn''t seem as in focus as it could be (not as sharp). I know the parallel lines are supposed to be the main subject, but I almost feel liek I want to see more detail of the deer in behind as well. You may be able to address this next time by playing around with depth of field. However, I really like that you did something unique and original. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the concept here. I''m not sure if this was originally a lot bigger and you cropped a small piece of the image or not. It''s a bit grainy with lots of image noise. It also somehow doesn''t seem as in focus as it could be (not as sharp). I know the parallel lines are supposed to be the main subject, but I almost feel liek I want to see more detail of the deer in behind as well. You may be able to address this next time by playing around with depth of field. However, I really like that you did something unique and original. Good luck!', '2004-03-19 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(628869, 64973, 15207, '<td valign="top">A really nice image. I really like the flower against the strings. -8</td>', 'A really nice image. I really like the flower against the strings. -8', '2004-03-19 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(628871, 64975, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. -8</td>', 'Really nice shot. -8', '2004-03-19 16:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(628873, 64897, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. I love the blurred jogger in behind. There aren''t too many unique and original tree images in this challenge but I really like what you''ve done with this one. -8</td>', 'Really nice shot. I love the blurred jogger in behind. There aren''t too many unique and original tree images in this challenge but I really like what you''ve done with this one. -8', '2004-03-19 16:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
