(629940, 64365, 9906, '<td valign="top">Due to the harshness of the lighting, this appears to be very ''flat''.<br/>TC</td>', 'Due to the harshness of the lighting, this appears to be very ''flat''.TC', '2004-03-21 02:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(629941, 64725, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this shot is a little confusing to me at first viewing.  First thing I thought was why isn''t the buliding coming up from the bottom of the frame.  Second thought was what am I supposed to be looking at.  The lines of the building lead my eye through the shot into the sky, but there is a light right in the middle of the shot that interupts the flow...  <br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO this shot is a little confusing to me at first viewing.  First thing I thought was why isn''t the buliding coming up from the bottom of the frame.  Second thought was what am I supposed to be looking at.  The lines of the building lead my eye through the shot into the sky, but there is a light right in the middle of the shot that interupts the flow...  TC', '2004-03-21 02:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
