(630046, 64458, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great, eye catching image.  This is great.</td>', 'Great, eye catching image.  This is great.', '2004-03-21 08:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(630049, 64880, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Like the monochromatic tones and interesting perspective.</td>', 'Great shot.  Like the monochromatic tones and interesting perspective.', '2004-03-21 08:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(630052, 65010, 17505, '<td valign="top">So the parallel is suposed to be the edge of the shadow and the edge of her body, right? It''s a nice shot with good colors and tones,  but I don''t think everyone''s going to see the parallel lines or agree that they are ''parallel'' and you will be marked down for not meeting the chllenge. Too bad, good shot although the door handle doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'So the parallel is suposed to be the edge of the shadow and the edge of her body, right? It''s a nice shot with good colors and tones,  but I don''t think everyone''s going to see the parallel lines or agree that they are ''parallel'' and you will be marked down for not meeting the chllenge. Too bad, good shot although the door handle doesn''t do anything for me.', '2004-03-21 08:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(630054, 65010, 18073, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image.  Nice lighting too.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image.  Nice lighting too.', '2004-03-21 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(630060, 65016, 17505, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but feel it could use a bit more contrast. More whites and less greys. The border also really calls attention to the lask of contract. If that''s exactly the look you were going for, then ignore me. It''s an artistic observation so...you know.</td>', 'I like this picture, but feel it could use a bit more contrast. More whites and less greys. The border also really calls attention to the lask of contract. If that''s exactly the look you were going for, then ignore me. It''s an artistic observation so...you know.', '2004-03-21 08:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(630066, 64780, 17505, '<td valign="top">I like this photo as it relates to the challenge, but the picture on its own seems a little off. The pillars are nice, especially the way you have the shadows almost straight below the pillars. The waves are an interesting element. But, the colors feel forced, like they were played with in photoshop. If they weren''t then I appologize for marking this a little lower because of it.</td>', 'I like this photo as it relates to the challenge, but the picture on its own seems a little off. The pillars are nice, especially the way you have the shadows almost straight below the pillars. The waves are an interesting element. But, the colors feel forced, like they were played with in photoshop. If they weren''t then I appologize for marking this a little lower because of it.', '2004-03-21 08:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(630071, 64227, 11486, '<td valign="top">Also photograped pianokeys (a keyboard), but a different angle. Nice to se something similar.</td>', 'Also photograped pianokeys (a keyboard), but a different angle. Nice to se something similar.', '2004-03-21 08:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(630073, 64818, 11486, '<td valign="top">Realy nice colors!</td>', 'Realy nice colors!', '2004-03-21 08:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(630076, 64341, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting and Creative! I''m not good at self portraits, so I''m even more impressed by this one. The only problem that I see is the green tint throughout the middle of the frame. To the left is black on white, then the body seems green but as we move right it fades back to black on white. I think this would have been much more successful in true black and white. Very nice picture though! <br/> <br/>Later: I was thinking of cropping out the face and hand because they are distracting. That would make it more abstract.  But I really liked the lines along the neck and would have been loath to give then up.</td>', 'Interesting and Creative! I''m not good at self portraits, so I''m even more impressed by this one. The only problem that I see is the green tint throughout the middle of the frame. To the left is black on white, then the body seems green but as we move right it fades back to black on white. I think this would have been much more successful in true black and white. Very nice picture though!  Later: I was thinking of cropping out the face and hand because they are distracting. That would make it more abstract.  But I really liked the lines along the neck and would have been loath to give then up.', '2004-03-21 08:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(630077, 64715, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not the best rail photo in challenge, but i like the color eftects.</td>', 'Not the best rail photo in challenge, but i like the color eftects.', '2004-03-21 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(630080, 64909, 11486, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the pencils are distored (in processing?)</td>', 'Good idea, but the pencils are distored (in processing?)', '2004-03-21 08:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(630083, 64721, 11486, '<td valign="top">A little to strong light in center and slightly dark.</td>', 'A little to strong light in center and slightly dark.', '2004-03-21 09:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
