(630588, 64431, 13305, '<td valign="top">I think that the parallel line challenge is to use the lines to lead the viewer to a particular spot in the photo.  There''s too many places to draw the eye in this photo.</td>', 'I think that the parallel line challenge is to use the lines to lead the viewer to a particular spot in the photo.  There''s too many places to draw the eye in this photo.', '2004-03-21 21:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(630595, 65029, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  But the lines are going in the same plane as your subject.  Guess that''s actually pretty in line with the challenge. I think i''d prefer if the subject were at the bottom of the stairs and the camera at the top.</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  But the lines are going in the same plane as your subject.  Guess that''s actually pretty in line with the challenge. I think i''d prefer if the subject were at the bottom of the stairs and the camera at the top.', '2004-03-21 21:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
