(630608, 64749, 14700, '<td valign="top">Too bad the entire photo could not have had that pinkish carpet go off in the distance.... or if you had an extra remnant you could have curved it up against the wall.... like an infinity wall.  With a shallow enough DOF it would look like the carpet went off into the distance.<br/> <br/>Anywho.  I think your subject matter was a great idea.  I like the color of the carpet.  I feel like you could have had a top ten with this if it were executed a little differently.<br/> <br/>I don''t really like the wall.  It''s just competing for attention.</td>', 'Too bad the entire photo could not have had that pinkish carpet go off in the distance.... or if you had an extra remnant you could have curved it up against the wall.... like an infinity wall.  With a shallow enough DOF it would look like the carpet went off into the distance. Anywho.  I think your subject matter was a great idea.  I like the color of the carpet.  I feel like you could have had a top ten with this if it were executed a little differently. I don''t really like the wall.  It''s just competing for attention.', '2004-03-21 22:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(630609, 64727, 2333, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the composition. Two things detract, first the blue channel is overexposed, and second the file size is very small (17k). When you are compressing, try for 125-145k.</td>', 'I like the subject and the composition. Two things detract, first the blue channel is overexposed, and second the file size is very small (17k). When you are compressing, try for 125-145k.', '2004-03-21 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
