(630683, 64507, 17485, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I like the contrast and the overall scene.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I like the contrast and the overall scene.  Well done!', '2004-03-21 23:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(630684, 64758, 9747, '<td valign="top">This is a great image! I love how there are many parallels here... the drummers''  hands with the sticks, their postures, the whiteness of the drum tops/bottoms, and the line of shadow cast by the drums'' platform. Together, like an arrow, they all point from the left to the right. The blue thing (curtain?) on the top-left side is a little bit distracting, but not overly so. Congratulations on capturing such a lovely and vibrant photograph!</td>', 'This is a great image! I love how there are many parallels here... the drummers''  hands with the sticks, their postures, the whiteness of the drum tops/bottoms, and the line of shadow cast by the drums'' platform. Together, like an arrow, they all point from the left to the right. The blue thing (curtain?) on the top-left side is a little bit distracting, but not overly so. Congratulations on capturing such a lovely and vibrant photograph!', '2004-03-21 23:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(630692, 64578, 9747, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail, it looked like a road going into a tunnel or something like that. I had to grin when I viewed the larger picture. Very cool! Just needs a little more contrast, I think. Good job, it''s a very creative way of using parallel lines.</td>', 'From the thumbnail, it looked like a road going into a tunnel or something like that. I had to grin when I viewed the larger picture. Very cool! Just needs a little more contrast, I think. Good job, it''s a very creative way of using parallel lines.', '2004-03-21 23:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(630696, 64826, 9747, '<td valign="top">Image is too small. And a bit too blurry as well, and the tree in foreground is in the way. However, good concept! I like the motion blur of the van, it shows action very nicely.</td>', 'Image is too small. And a bit too blurry as well, and the tree in foreground is in the way. However, good concept! I like the motion blur of the van, it shows action very nicely.', '2004-03-21 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(630739, 64715, 18505, '<td valign="top">Great use of lines, and I LOVE the blue rails.  Great picture.</td>', 'Great use of lines, and I LOVE the blue rails.  Great picture.', '2004-03-22 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(630748, 64206, 9747, '<td valign="top">The high contrast and limited colors (mostly black, yellow, and white) of this image is very effective. With the model being framed in by the whiteness and the posts, one is easily drawn to the model''s face. This would make an excellent cover for a music CD or something like that. ;-) Good job!</td>', 'The high contrast and limited colors (mostly black, yellow, and white) of this image is very effective. With the model being framed in by the whiteness and the posts, one is easily drawn to the model''s face. This would make an excellent cover for a music CD or something like that. ;-) Good job!', '2004-03-22 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(630772, 64341, 18505, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of lines.  Excellent photo.  How did you do it???</td>', 'Very creative use of lines.  Excellent photo.  How did you do it???', '2004-03-22 00:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(630777, 64892, 9747, '<td valign="top">While the concept is there (parallel floorboards and the lines on cat''s bow(?)), the picture itself is somewhat unexciting and not too creative. It''s also a little fuzzy and the cat''s position is a bit awkward. Great-looking cat though, and I like the lighting in general!</td>', 'While the concept is there (parallel floorboards and the lines on cat''s bow(?)), the picture itself is somewhat unexciting and not too creative. It''s also a little fuzzy and the cat''s position is a bit awkward. Great-looking cat though, and I like the lighting in general!', '2004-03-22 00:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(630801, 64395, 9747, '<td valign="top">I liked the title. :-) Great lines, the picture probably would be better if the shingles/roof were cropped out. This would make the viewer take a really good, close look at the image and guess if it''s snow or folds of white velvet fabric. Or the folds of a white SharPei! Overall, excellent shot and lighting!</td>', 'I liked the title. :-) Great lines, the picture probably would be better if the shingles/roof were cropped out. This would make the viewer take a really good, close look at the image and guess if it''s snow or folds of white velvet fabric. Or the folds of a white SharPei! Overall, excellent shot and lighting!', '2004-03-22 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
