(631946, 64932, 18709, '<td valign="top">These bolts look as if they are good friends, chatting over the garden wall, and it gives this picture a peaceful look, rather at odds with the function of the bolts which is security.  The colour is rather strange but not unpleasant.</td>', 'These bolts look as if they are good friends, chatting over the garden wall, and it gives this picture a peaceful look, rather at odds with the function of the bolts which is security.  The colour is rather strange but not unpleasant.', '2004-03-22 15:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(631950, 64946, 18361, '<td valign="top">*hides* :P great picture</td>', '*hides* :P great picture', '2004-03-22 15:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(631952, 64551, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think you are in good company here.  Disappearing railway lines are here in abundance.  These are as good as most, but again, I think the subject is a bit too ''easy'' and available to be really  interesting.</td>', 'I think you are in good company here.  Disappearing railway lines are here in abundance.  These are as good as most, but again, I think the subject is a bit too ''easy'' and available to be really  interesting.', '2004-03-22 15:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(631956, 64182, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot. The fallen boards? at the end of the pier mean that the lines are converging on ''something'' instead of just diappearing into the haze.  <br/>The water is exceptionally good and almost seems to move as I look at it.  <br/>Couldn''t be better.</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot. The fallen boards? at the end of the pier mean that the lines are converging on ''something'' instead of just diappearing into the haze.  The water is exceptionally good and almost seems to move as I look at it.  Couldn''t be better.', '2004-03-22 15:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(631965, 64313, 18709, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to make out if this passage is going up or down. It keeps changing for me.<br/>But the scene is rather bare and uninviting.  A figure of someone walking would have given it scale and perhaps a bit more interest.</td>', 'It''s hard to make out if this passage is going up or down. It keeps changing for me.But the scene is rather bare and uninviting.  A figure of someone walking would have given it scale and perhaps a bit more interest.', '2004-03-22 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(631972, 64846, 18709, '<td valign="top">These look like tiles and are well positioned.  I think you''ve got it right.</td>', 'These look like tiles and are well positioned.  I think you''ve got it right.', '2004-03-22 15:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(631982, 64456, 18709, '<td valign="top">I''m very fond of ferns, so your picture hits the spot.  Amazing how nature''s parallels are so much more beautiful than ours are.</td>', 'I''m very fond of ferns, so your picture hits the spot.  Amazing how nature''s parallels are so much more beautiful than ours are.', '2004-03-22 15:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(631985, 64884, 17937, '<td valign="top">This could have been for the orange challenge as well...</td>', 'This could have been for the orange challenge as well...', '2004-03-22 15:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(631989, 64686, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a little more interesting thatn most of the rail pictures since the opposing lines of the sleepers, which you expect to see are not very obvious. nonetheless, I think we need a bit more imagination.</td>', 'This is a little more interesting thatn most of the rail pictures since the opposing lines of the sleepers, which you expect to see are not very obvious. nonetheless, I think we need a bit more imagination.', '2004-03-22 15:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(631991, 64609, 11895, '<td valign="top">lovely photo but doesn''t fit well in Parallel Lines</td>', 'lovely photo but doesn''t fit well in Parallel Lines', '2004-03-22 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(632000, 65022, 18709, '<td valign="top">I take it that these are growing trees, trimmed into this rather stiff shape. But what a good subject for this competition.  The fact that they vary a little takes away any feelings of repetition.  I like this one.</td>', 'I take it that these are growing trees, trimmed into this rather stiff shape. But what a good subject for this competition.  The fact that they vary a little takes away any feelings of repetition.  I like this one.', '2004-03-22 15:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(632006, 64759, 18709, '<td valign="top">Looking at this, I feel as if I am in a plane that is banking sharply to the right.  It is a very  good illusion. Is it a structure, possibly an arch.</td>', 'Looking at this, I feel as if I am in a plane that is banking sharply to the right.  It is a very  good illusion. Is it a structure, possibly an arch.', '2004-03-22 15:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(632012, 64930, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very good arrangement, and beautiful colours; pity about the loss of focus to the right, which is quite disturbing.</td>', 'Very good arrangement, and beautiful colours; pity about the loss of focus to the right, which is quite disturbing.', '2004-03-22 15:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(632017, 64316, 18709, '<td valign="top">I counted them and I got a different result. Never mind.  You have found just the right viewpoint.  I don''t suppose there are too many cityscapes with quite that number of parallels.</td>', 'I counted them and I got a different result. Never mind.  You have found just the right viewpoint.  I don''t suppose there are too many cityscapes with quite that number of parallels.', '2004-03-22 15:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
