(632066, 64103, 18709, '<td valign="top">The screen is in good focus, and obviously you wanted the background to be out of focus, which it is, but my eyes keep trying to see what is there and it is intriguing.</td>', 'The screen is in good focus, and obviously you wanted the background to be out of focus, which it is, but my eyes keep trying to see what is there and it is intriguing.', '2004-03-22 16:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
