(632253, 64693, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a building which gives no hint of its structure, just the glass cladding.  This it is a good subject for this challenge.  The reflections on the left-hand side of the picture relieve the overall silvery colour and make it a good shot.</td>', 'This is a building which gives no hint of its structure, just the glass cladding.  This it is a good subject for this challenge.  The reflections on the left-hand side of the picture relieve the overall silvery colour and make it a good shot.', '2004-03-22 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
