(632266, 64746, 18709, '<td valign="top">In addition to the original idea, this picture adds nostalgia. Books lovingly kept over the years, with memories stored in them.   There is a strong atmosphere about this.</td>', 'In addition to the original idea, this picture adds nostalgia. Books lovingly kept over the years, with memories stored in them.   There is a strong atmosphere about this.', '2004-03-22 18:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
