(632276, 64713, 18709, '<td valign="top">The bright edges stand out clearly and are well placed.</td>', 'The bright edges stand out clearly and are well placed.', '2004-03-22 18:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(632280, 64718, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a nice natural picture, my only complaint would be that the end of  the road is rather over-exposed.  It is good to have a path heading ino the distance, but this perspective is not very deep and ends in a blinding light.</td>', 'This is a nice natural picture, my only complaint would be that the end of  the road is rather over-exposed.  It is good to have a path heading ino the distance, but this perspective is not very deep and ends in a blinding light.', '2004-03-22 18:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(632288, 64869, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very spooky, without being scary.  You look like a very benign supernatural being.<br/>I hope the ''real'' ones are as nice.  Having left so much space on the left-hand side of the picture, I think it might have been better had you been looking slightly in that direction.  Otherwise why is there so much black?</td>', 'Very spooky, without being scary.  You look like a very benign supernatural being.I hope the ''real'' ones are as nice.  Having left so much space on the left-hand side of the picture, I think it might have been better had you been looking slightly in that direction.  Otherwise why is there so much black?', '2004-03-22 18:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(632294, 64933, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is the best-looking washing-line I can ever remember seeing, and the clothes-pegs scattered at random give it variety and colour.</td>', 'This is the best-looking washing-line I can ever remember seeing, and the clothes-pegs scattered at random give it variety and colour.', '2004-03-22 18:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(632300, 64309, 18709, '<td valign="top">You have to wait for this kind of shot.. or be lucky.  The sun shining off the roof of the plane and on the water, promise better weather to come. The sunlight is quite isolated in that spot, since you can see the dark horizon beyond it. The rays <br/>can only be seen this clearly when the weather is foul.</td>', 'You have to wait for this kind of shot.. or be lucky.  The sun shining off the roof of the plane and on the water, promise better weather to come. The sunlight is quite isolated in that spot, since you can see the dark horizon beyond it. The rays can only be seen this clearly when the weather is foul.', '2004-03-22 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(632302, 64656, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the roof-line of the chalet- like station run almost parallel with the tracks. It lifts this above most of the other railway photos. (Sorry about all the hyphens).</td>', 'I like the way that the roof-line of the chalet- like station run almost parallel with the tracks. It lifts this above most of the other railway photos. (Sorry about all the hyphens).', '2004-03-22 18:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(632304, 64908, 18709, '<td valign="top">This one takes the eye on a journey, and won''t let it wander away from its<br/>destinatio,.it is very compelling.  Even so, a figure, some way down the line, might have given it scale, which I think it needs.  Good anyway.</td>', 'This one takes the eye on a journey, and won''t let it wander away from itsdestinatio,.it is very compelling.  Even so, a figure, some way down the line, might have given it scale, which I think it needs.  Good anyway.', '2004-03-22 18:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(632306, 64691, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is quite a handsome object. Who would believe that the humble safety-match could achieve such heights of artistry. I think this is very very good.</td>', 'This is quite a handsome object. Who would believe that the humble safety-match could achieve such heights of artistry. I think this is very very good.', '2004-03-22 18:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(632308, 64774, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is good.  The diagonals contrast nicely with the straight lines and the overall<br/>sunnyness of it is affecting.</td>', 'This is good.  The diagonals contrast nicely with the straight lines and the overallsunnyness of it is affecting.', '2004-03-22 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(632309, 64780, 17890, '<td valign="top">beatufil!</td>', 'beatufil!', '2004-03-22 18:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(632312, 64732, 18709, '<td valign="top">This has a ghostly feel to it.  Is it taken through a frosted window or something like that.  I canb''t say that I find it very interesting, except for the technique, which is surefooted.  It is a bit too monochrome for a colour picture.</td>', 'This has a ghostly feel to it.  Is it taken through a frosted window or something like that.  I canb''t say that I find it very interesting, except for the technique, which is surefooted.  It is a bit too monochrome for a colour picture.', '2004-03-22 18:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(632314, 64522, 18709, '<td valign="top">Well-taken and well named.  The light shining through the slats of venetian blinds has always fascinated me, and this is a good example.</td>', 'Well-taken and well named.  The light shining through the slats of venetian blinds has always fascinated me, and this is a good example.', '2004-03-22 18:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(632315, 64545, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but I think the yellow cabs  would have to be closer together to make this come off successfully.</td>', 'This is a good idea but I think the yellow cabs  would have to be closer together to make this come off successfully.', '2004-03-22 18:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(632317, 64998, 18709, '<td valign="top">It is a beautiful g ate, but I am always wary of taking pictures of parts of this kind of thing.  I don''t suppose that the whole gate would really have qualified for <br/>this challenge, only the central straight bars, but I just don''t think it comes off.<br/>Sorry.</td>', 'It is a beautiful g ate, but I am always wary of taking pictures of parts of this kind of thing.  I don''t suppose that the whole gate would really have qualified for this challenge, only the central straight bars, but I just don''t think it comes off.Sorry.', '2004-03-22 18:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(632321, 64341, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional picture.  I like it enormously. And to have taken it yourself makes it better still.</td>', 'This is an exceptional picture.  I like it enormously. And to have taken it yourself makes it better still.', '2004-03-22 18:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(632327, 64211, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to have seen a bit of the floor, this kind of waist-high shot feels uncomfortable.</td>', 'I think I would like to have seen a bit of the floor, this kind of waist-high shot feels uncomfortable.', '2004-03-22 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(632328, 64444, 18709, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is rather ''bitty'' and although it complies with the challenge I don''yt think it comes off very well/</td>', 'I think this picture is rather ''bitty'' and although it complies with the challenge I don''yt think it comes off very well/', '2004-03-22 18:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(632332, 64151, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is OK.. but only OK.  Not very challenging and not much to do with this challenge unless you count  the netting iun the background.</td>', 'This is OK.. but only OK.  Not very challenging and not much to do with this challenge unless you count  the netting iun the background.', '2004-03-22 18:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(632335, 65008, 18709, '<td valign="top">Very original. and very good.  It has a certain  ''home-made''  look about it which is appealing.</td>', 'Very original. and very good.  It has a certain  ''home-made''  look about it which is appealing.', '2004-03-22 18:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(632339, 64127, 18709, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do much for me, although it is well-taken.  Bathroom tiles have <br/>a sort of monotony (although here, the reflection is a different shade) and <br/>I find them a bit off-putting.  That maybe just me.</td>', 'This doesn''t do much for me, although it is well-taken.  Bathroom tiles have a sort of monotony (although here, the reflection is a different shade) and I find them a bit off-putting.  That maybe just me.', '2004-03-22 19:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(632345, 64487, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like the two parallels on this side of the road, which counterpoint the railings across the road.  The building in the distanace looks a bit like the Royal Observatory at Greenwich, am I right. This is nice.</td>', 'I like the two parallels on this side of the road, which counterpoint the railings across the road.  The building in the distanace looks a bit like the Royal Observatory at Greenwich, am I right. This is nice.', '2004-03-22 19:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(632351, 64727, 18709, '<td valign="top">Terrific perspective here.  The wind-turbines,  the canal and the roadway, all converging in the far distance.  I think this is as good as it gets.</td>', 'Terrific perspective here.  The wind-turbines,  the canal and the roadway, all converging in the far distance.  I think this is as good as it gets.', '2004-03-22 19:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(632355, 64461, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is one of those gooey pictures that don''t relly appeal to me much.  Except in this case for the colours which are nicely graduated.</td>', 'This is one of those gooey pictures that don''t relly appeal to me much.  Except in this case for the colours which are nicely graduated.', '2004-03-22 19:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(632363, 64706, 18709, '<td valign="top">The bright (new?) wood on the back and the seat make this very striking.  It seems to say, ''come and sit here''.   I think it is well-placed in the picture and I don''t think it could be better done.</td>', 'The bright (new?) wood on the back and the seat make this very striking.  It seems to say, ''come and sit here''.   I think it is well-placed in the picture and I don''t think it could be better done.', '2004-03-22 19:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(632367, 64510, 18709, '<td valign="top">The streetlamp, exactly filling the space between the buildings lifts this one abovethe average. Well above.  Thaat and the open window save it from being <br/>a dull affair.</td>', 'The streetlamp, exactly filling the space between the buildings lifts this one abovethe average. Well above.  Thaat and the open window save it from being a dull affair.', '2004-03-22 19:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(632376, 64542, 18709, '<td valign="top">YOu have to be lucky to get a shot of such pristine snow or you have to prepare for it and be ready.   Whatev er, this is a good picture, with the tyre tracks disappearing into the distance  and all the trees still laden with fresh snow.  <br/>Very evocative.</td>', 'YOu have to be lucky to get a shot of such pristine snow or you have to prepare for it and be ready.   Whatev er, this is a good picture, with the tyre tracks disappearing into the distance  and all the trees still laden with fresh snow.  Very evocative.', '2004-03-22 19:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(632382, 64873, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is OK. I think i would have preferred a darker background, which would have made it more dramatic.</td>', 'This is OK. I think i would have preferred a darker background, which would have made it more dramatic.', '2004-03-22 19:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(632385, 64237, 18709, '<td valign="top">Lovely imaging here.  The posts and the masts; even the clouds co-operated and gave you a horizontal, sort of.  A picture which is better than the usual boat scenes, which can become very cliched.</td>', 'Lovely imaging here.  The posts and the masts; even the clouds co-operated and gave you a horizontal, sort of.  A picture which is better than the usual boat scenes, which can become very cliched.', '2004-03-22 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(632392, 64851, 18709, '<td valign="top">It is always encouraging to see seedling coming through.  Unfortunately, they don''t always make an interesting picture.  This is one of the better ones, and yet, <br/>it doesn''t have much impact.</td>', 'It is always encouraging to see seedling coming through.  Unfortunately, they don''t always make an interesting picture.  This is one of the better ones, and yet, it doesn''t have much impact.', '2004-03-22 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(632396, 64673, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is an odd but interesting image.  The parallel of the chopsticks and the layered tomato slices nicely contrast with each other.</td>', 'This is an odd but interesting image.  The parallel of the chopsticks and the layered tomato slices nicely contrast with each other.', '2004-03-22 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(632398, 64536, 18709, '<td valign="top">The two sides of the picture are so alike, they almost look like a mirror image, except for the lamp-post. I find that the overall greyness is a little bit drab, otherwise I can''t fault it.</td>', 'The two sides of the picture are so alike, they almost look like a mirror image, except for the lamp-post. I find that the overall greyness is a little bit drab, otherwise I can''t fault it.', '2004-03-22 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(632404, 64975, 18709, '<td valign="top">A nice rustic image.  The ivy highligting the parallels are unusual.   I wish we could have seen a few more rungs.  It would be a bit more convincing.</td>', 'A nice rustic image.  The ivy highligting the parallels are unusual.   I wish we could have seen a few more rungs.  It would be a bit more convincing.', '2004-03-22 19:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(632435, 64814, 14601, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I would rate this photo very high if it were in color - but in grayscale, I love it. I can almost FEEL the cold and damp. Excellent entry.</td>', 'I don''t think I would rate this photo very high if it were in color - but in grayscale, I love it. I can almost FEEL the cold and damp. Excellent entry.', '2004-03-22 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(632440, 64892, 18080, '<td valign="top">yet another cat...</td>', 'yet another cat...', '2004-03-22 19:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(632441, 64745, 14601, '<td valign="top">Subdued colors yet powerful composition. I like the way the stairs are cut off so that the landing is not showing. Very nice.</td>', 'Subdued colors yet powerful composition. I like the way the stairs are cut off so that the landing is not showing. Very nice.', '2004-03-22 19:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(632445, 64780, 14601, '<td valign="top">I Love the way that the dark verticals lead my eye to the sun. Very nice.</td>', 'I Love the way that the dark verticals lead my eye to the sun. Very nice.', '2004-03-22 19:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(632449, 65032, 14601, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color and grayscale in the same photo. The effect of the blinds making the shadow "bleed" is terrific.</td>', 'Excellent use of color and grayscale in the same photo. The effect of the blinds making the shadow "bleed" is terrific.', '2004-03-22 19:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(632453, 64721, 14601, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting effect - it works very well for this setup. The use of negative space to offset the dominoes really makes this photo. Very nice.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting effect - it works very well for this setup. The use of negative space to offset the dominoes really makes this photo. Very nice.', '2004-03-22 19:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(632459, 64795, 18318, '<td valign="top">At first i didn`t like this picture at all , but i came back for a second then a third look.....then a fourth... really nice image.</td>', 'At first i didn`t like this picture at all , but i came back for a second then a third look.....then a fourth... really nice image.', '2004-03-22 19:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(632462, 64690, 18318, '<td valign="top">might have looked better cropped to the middle lamp-post on both sides... otherwise good shot.</td>', 'might have looked better cropped to the middle lamp-post on both sides... otherwise good shot.', '2004-03-22 19:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(632463, 64698, 18318, '<td valign="top">ooh</td>', 'ooh', '2004-03-22 19:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
