(632767, 64461, 13305, '<td valign="top">I thnk I understand your reasoning on this, it just doesn''t go with the greater majority in this challenge.  Interesting pic, but I''m not able to understand enough to give a very high rating.</td>', 'I thnk I understand your reasoning on this, it just doesn''t go with the greater majority in this challenge.  Interesting pic, but I''m not able to understand enough to give a very high rating.', '2004-03-23 00:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(632770, 64875, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but not terribly interesting either.  Are your using the parallels to direct attention to the toothpaste or from the toothpaste to the brush.  If the toothpaste is involved, try to get it where the transparent stripe is up and lets light into the whole blob.</td>', 'Not bad, but not terribly interesting either.  Are your using the parallels to direct attention to the toothpaste or from the toothpaste to the brush.  If the toothpaste is involved, try to get it where the transparent stripe is up and lets light into the whole blob.', '2004-03-23 00:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(632771, 65008, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I think this could be done more creatively.  You have lots of lines, but not many parallels. Try a different angle, rather than straight on. This might have looked good on a lighteer background with light from the side to show up the parallels.</td>', 'Interesting, but I think this could be done more creatively.  You have lots of lines, but not many parallels. Try a different angle, rather than straight on. This might have looked good on a lighteer background with light from the side to show up the parallels.', '2004-03-23 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(632772, 64336, 13305, '<td valign="top">A line of light, OK. But what''s it leading to? Put more subject to see or lighten the background if there is something there not visible.</td>', 'A line of light, OK. But what''s it leading to? Put more subject to see or lighten the background if there is something there not visible.', '2004-03-23 00:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(632775, 64874, 13305, '<td valign="top">Bike spokes are not parallel.  Try attaching 2 reflectors to the wheel and spin it with light shining on the reflector, result would be 2 parallel paths of light.  Keep trying.</td>', 'Bike spokes are not parallel.  Try attaching 2 reflectors to the wheel and spin it with light shining on the reflector, result would be 2 parallel paths of light.  Keep trying.', '2004-03-23 00:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(632780, 64425, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not a bad pic, but I don''t really see the parallel lines.  Are you saying parallel lines of the sides of they rail? Why not show both rails. If you want to emphasize the parallel lines of the ties, why not get down closer to their level.</td>', 'Not a bad pic, but I don''t really see the parallel lines.  Are you saying parallel lines of the sides of they rail? Why not show both rails. If you want to emphasize the parallel lines of the ties, why not get down closer to their level.', '2004-03-23 00:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(632783, 64252, 13305, '<td valign="top">Are the lines you''re using the lines of squares on the board or a line of pieces in a row?  If the board squares, back off and get several leading up to the king.  If a row of pieces, elevate your camera above the board where that line is more obvious.  P.S.  Your board has a water ring on it. :-&gt;</td>', 'Are the lines you''re using the lines of squares on the board or a line of pieces in a row?  If the board squares, back off and get several leading up to the king.  If a row of pieces, elevate your camera above the board where that line is more obvious.  P.S.  Your board has a water ring on it. :->', '2004-03-23 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(632785, 64987, 13305, '<td valign="top">Does her hair have parallel lines, or did you get in late for the off screen expectations?   Not really a bad pic, I''d like to see it in color.</td>', 'Does her hair have parallel lines, or did you get in late for the off screen expectations?   Not really a bad pic, I''d like to see it in color.', '2004-03-23 00:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(632786, 64801, 13305, '<td valign="top">I can see the parallel of the side of the sign and the steeple of the church.  But the image is so underexposed, I''m not sure.</td>', 'I can see the parallel of the side of the sign and the steeple of the church.  But the image is so underexposed, I''m not sure.', '2004-03-23 01:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(632787, 64763, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I almost didn''t catch the parallels of the wings until I had looked at this about 4-5 times.  Try something a little more obvious for us slow folk.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I almost didn''t catch the parallels of the wings until I had looked at this about 4-5 times.  Try something a little more obvious for us slow folk.', '2004-03-23 01:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(632790, 64322, 13305, '<td valign="top">Your parallel lines are not very obvious, mainly I think because there isn''t something for them to lead to.  Try switching to a lighter background light it from the side to catch the parallels of the pins and their shadows.</td>', 'Your parallel lines are not very obvious, mainly I think because there isn''t something for them to lead to.  Try switching to a lighter background light it from the side to catch the parallels of the pins and their shadows.', '2004-03-23 01:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(632794, 65010, 13305, '<td valign="top">I think this deserves a 10.  Why? <br/>1. A female body part always grabs my attention (I''m a guy, live with it)<br/>2. The parallel lines of the her body and shadow are really interesting. <br/>3. The 2 handles draw the eye to the other parallel lines mentioned in 2. <br/>Great image.</td>', 'I think this deserves a 10.  Why? 1. A female body part always grabs my attention (I''m a guy, live with it)2. The parallel lines of the her body and shadow are really interesting. 3. The 2 handles draw the eye to the other parallel lines mentioned in 2. Great image.', '2004-03-23 01:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
