(632965, 64333, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is clever and well-taken.I see that the glasses have to be filled with water, because at the very top, the effect ceases. I think this is exceptional.</td>', 'This is clever and well-taken.I see that the glasses have to be filled with water, because at the very top, the effect ceases. I think this is exceptional.', '2004-03-23 06:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(632967, 64663, 18709, '<td valign="top">I can''t say that I am very fond of photos of parts of doors, etc.   I can see the point however.  The mirrored door reflects the lintel in a silvery way, which adds some spice to this.</td>', 'I can''t say that I am very fond of photos of parts of doors, etc.   I can see the point however.  The mirrored door reflects the lintel in a silvery way, which adds some spice to this.', '2004-03-23 06:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(632968, 64737, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a very deceptive one, taken from the best viewpoint possible.  Very good indeed.</td>', 'This is a very deceptive one, taken from the best viewpoint possible.  Very good indeed.', '2004-03-23 06:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(632970, 64591, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is what a rail picture should look like.  It needs more interest then just the receding rails, however picturesque they may be.  Well done.</td>', 'This is what a rail picture should look like.  It needs more interest then just the receding rails, however picturesque they may be.  Well done.', '2004-03-23 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(632972, 64826, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is not the sort of thing I like very much, but it is well-taken, and the effect of speed is enhanced by the fact that the van is on the way out of the picture; It looks as if it is going somewhere.</td>', 'This is not the sort of thing I like very much, but it is well-taken, and the effect of speed is enhanced by the fact that the van is on the way out of the picture; It looks as if it is going somewhere.', '2004-03-23 06:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(632974, 64835, 18709, '<td valign="top">This picture has lots of interest, notable the rickety look of the fence.and the tortuous path it is following.  The shadows and the pebbles in the foreground add some texture which is otherwise lacking.</td>', 'This picture has lots of interest, notable the rickety look of the fence.and the tortuous path it is following.  The shadows and the pebbles in the foreground add some texture which is otherwise lacking.', '2004-03-23 06:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(632975, 64909, 18709, '<td valign="top">A good idea, and very colourful.  Not quite so menacing as a previous one I commented on. these look rather friendly; especially the grey one with the broken point.</td>', 'A good idea, and very colourful.  Not quite so menacing as a previous one I commented on. these look rather friendly; especially the grey one with the broken point.', '2004-03-23 07:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(632976, 64169, 18709, '<td valign="top">I find it hard to make out what this is; some kind of one-armed bandit? Whatever it is, the slight mystery adds to its flavour, and the chevrons lead the eye downwards to another mystery.   I like this.</td>', 'I find it hard to make out what this is; some kind of one-armed bandit? Whatever it is, the slight mystery adds to its flavour, and the chevrons lead the eye downwards to another mystery.   I like this.', '2004-03-23 07:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(632980, 64684, 18709, '<td valign="top">This picture is very nicely balanced. The chopsticks are elegant and almost look like somebody''s impossibly long legs.  I am not sure about the other objects shown, but they seem most appropriate. The focus starts to falter a bit on the lowest object, but I think that enhances the picture.</td>', 'This picture is very nicely balanced. The chopsticks are elegant and almost look like somebody''s impossibly long legs.  I am not sure about the other objects shown, but they seem most appropriate. The focus starts to falter a bit on the lowest object, but I think that enhances the picture.', '2004-03-23 07:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(632983, 64988, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture and I don''t think I could fault it if I wanted to.... and I don''t.  The log, with paches of green moss, the texture of the red legs, and faces and bills  couldn''t be bettered. The slightly ruffled feathers of the upper one relieve and possiblity (remote) of sameness. I think this is as good as it gets.</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture and I don''t think I could fault it if I wanted to.... and I don''t.  The log, with paches of green moss, the texture of the red legs, and faces and bills  couldn''t be bettered. The slightly ruffled feathers of the upper one relieve and possiblity (remote) of sameness. I think this is as good as it gets.', '2004-03-23 07:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(632985, 64690, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing view.  My only complaint would be that it is not quite vertical and appears to lean slightly to the right.  I find this disconcerting. I suppose it could be rectified with good editing,but that is  something I don''t know too much about.</td>', 'This is an intriguing view.  My only complaint would be that it is not quite vertical and appears to lean slightly to the right.  I find this disconcerting. I suppose it could be rectified with good editing,but that is  something I don''t know too much about.', '2004-03-23 07:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(632988, 65018, 18709, '<td valign="top">This has a nice  ghostly, old world look about it, enhanced by black and white.<br/>The camera settings must have been spot on to have the candle flame so <br/>clear and the tall candle and shadow exactly right.</td>', 'This has a nice  ghostly, old world look about it, enhanced by black and white.The camera settings must have been spot on to have the candle flame so clear and the tall candle and shadow exactly right.', '2004-03-23 07:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(632990, 64861, 18709, '<td valign="top">A very good long exposure, showing what can be done with this sort of thing with a bit of imagination.  There is no clutter and the railings (of the bridge?)<br/>set off the bright trails of light perfectly.</td>', 'A very good long exposure, showing what can be done with this sort of thing with a bit of imagination.  There is no clutter and the railings (of the bridge?)set off the bright trails of light perfectly.', '2004-03-23 07:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(632992, 64750, 18709, '<td valign="top">This has a long  long perspective,  which is always a bit mysterious, although on such a lovely spring day, mystery seems a long way off.</td>', 'This has a long  long perspective,  which is always a bit mysterious, although on such a lovely spring day, mystery seems a long way off.', '2004-03-23 07:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(632994, 64966, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like this . The building has reflections of itself, each wing reflect on the other (I think)  and enough parallel lines to satisfy any challenge.    Without any figures though , I find it a bit stark; figures do give scale  to something like this  But I couldn''t fault  the phtography.</td>', 'I like this . The building has reflections of itself, each wing reflect on the other (I think)  and enough parallel lines to satisfy any challenge.    Without any figures though , I find it a bit stark; figures do give scale  to something like this  But I couldn''t fault  the phtography.', '2004-03-23 07:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(632996, 64951, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject.  The border planting adds some flavour, and the colour of the fence, is pleasing.</td>', 'This is a good subject.  The border planting adds some flavour, and the colour of the fence, is pleasing.', '2004-03-23 07:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
