(633001, 64974, 18709, '<td valign="top">A good subject, and nobody could complain that there is nothing to relieve the boredom of the layers of bricks.  She keeps looking at me...  does she know something?          Very good.</td>', 'A good subject, and nobody could complain that there is nothing to relieve the boredom of the layers of bricks.  She keeps looking at me...  does she know something?          Very good.', '2004-03-23 07:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(633002, 64427, 18709, '<td valign="top">Who said ''bars do not a prison make''?  They certainly do in this case. Everything is there.. ( I suppose it would be unfair to insist that a prisoner pose for the  camera).   Very well done.</td>', 'Who said ''bars do not a prison make''?  They certainly do in this case. Everything is there.. ( I suppose it would be unfair to insist that a prisoner pose for the  camera).   Very well done.', '2004-03-23 07:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(633003, 64982, 18709, '<td valign="top">The trouble with taking a picture from a low angle is that the perspective refuses to co-operate, and insists on diminishing the image as it goes up.  Consequently the subjhect, which fits so nicely at the bottlom of the picture starts to leave the sides and almost give the picture he impression of widening at the top.  It is a very good subject however.</td>', 'The trouble with taking a picture from a low angle is that the perspective refuses to co-operate, and insists on diminishing the image as it goes up.  Consequently the subjhect, which fits so nicely at the bottlom of the picture starts to leave the sides and almost give the picture he impression of widening at the top.  It is a very good subject however.', '2004-03-23 07:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
