(633078, 64774, 9906, '<td valign="top">This kind of looks like you have some over sharpening artifacts, but I believe it is really just the harshness of the lighting.  You do have some jaggies caused by this though.  TC</td>', 'This kind of looks like you have some over sharpening artifacts, but I believe it is really just the harshness of the lighting.  You do have some jaggies caused by this though.  TC', '2004-03-23 08:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
