(633086, 64316, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm....I only count 1,784,382...  But seriously, your shot seems vey well composed, but very flat.  Taken at a different time of day, with the light and shadow emphasizing the textures, would make this pop a lot more!<br/>TC</td>', 'Hmmmmm....I only count 1,784,382...  But seriously, your shot seems vey well composed, but very flat.  Taken at a different time of day, with the light and shadow emphasizing the textures, would make this pop a lot more!TC', '2004-03-23 08:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(633096, 64363, 14255, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. Like the angle you have taken &amp; the textures on the post.</td>', 'An interesting shot. Like the angle you have taken & the textures on the post.', '2004-03-23 08:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
