(633102, 64312, 9906, '<td valign="top">If you have the opportunity, you should try taking this shot with your tripod (or camera if handheld) lowered to about two feet of the floor.  You would be surprised how different the shot will ''feel''<br/>TC</td>', 'If you have the opportunity, you should try taking this shot with your tripod (or camera if handheld) lowered to about two feet of the floor.  You would be surprised how different the shot will ''feel''TC', '2004-03-23 08:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
