(633119, 64993, 18542, '<td valign="top">clever idea, and very unique.  i find that my eyes wander, looking for a place to anchor, though.</td>', 'clever idea, and very unique.  i find that my eyes wander, looking for a place to anchor, though.', '2004-03-23 08:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(633120, 64767, 14255, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Would have cropped the bottom to remove the rectangular sign  as your eye is drawn to it &amp; distracts from the rest of the image which is far more interesting</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Would have cropped the bottom to remove the rectangular sign  as your eye is drawn to it & distracts from the rest of the image which is far more interesting', '2004-03-23 08:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(633121, 64400, 14255, '<td valign="top">Like the image but Parallels are not obvious</td>', 'Like the image but Parallels are not obvious', '2004-03-23 08:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(633122, 64694, 18542, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure that the lines strengthen the composition on this one.  perhaps with a different landscape being viewed, or a different angle.  it might be interesting if the grass were seen only between the bottom two bars, trees in the next section up, etc.  i''m not sure if that''s clear, it''s just the idea that struck when i looked at this.  i do like the contrast of colors here, i think that works well.</td>', 'i''m not sure that the lines strengthen the composition on this one.  perhaps with a different landscape being viewed, or a different angle.  it might be interesting if the grass were seen only between the bottom two bars, trees in the next section up, etc.  i''m not sure if that''s clear, it''s just the idea that struck when i looked at this.  i do like the contrast of colors here, i think that works well.', '2004-03-23 08:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(633123, 64309, 17818, '<td valign="top">i like this..</td>', 'i like this..', '2004-03-23 08:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(633124, 64461, 14255, '<td valign="top">Interesting (What is it) Like the flow of the curved lines</td>', 'Interesting (What is it) Like the flow of the curved lines', '2004-03-23 08:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(633126, 64696, 14255, '<td valign="top">Nicely focussed shot</td>', 'Nicely focussed shot', '2004-03-23 08:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(633128, 64698, 18542, '<td valign="top">very nice work.  this almost looks more like an illustration than a photograph, and i like the effect.  the composition is also nicely set up.  the trees echo each other into the background, and the frame is divided vertically into thirds.  great job.</td>', 'very nice work.  this almost looks more like an illustration than a photograph, and i like the effect.  the composition is also nicely set up.  the trees echo each other into the background, and the frame is divided vertically into thirds.  great job.', '2004-03-23 08:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(633129, 64682, 14255, '<td valign="top">The Car at bottom right hand corner is distracting</td>', 'The Car at bottom right hand corner is distracting', '2004-03-23 08:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(633132, 64671, 14255, '<td valign="top">Good use of light &amp; shade. I like the angle and the way the glimpses of sky get larger towards the top of the image</td>', 'Good use of light & shade. I like the angle and the way the glimpses of sky get larger towards the top of the image', '2004-03-23 08:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(633135, 64808, 18542, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lighting here.  still, i find myself waiting for something to happen.  i wonder if it would work to put someone or something on the stairs.</td>', 'nice composition and lighting here.  still, i find myself waiting for something to happen.  i wonder if it would work to put someone or something on the stairs.', '2004-03-23 08:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
