(633806, 64492, 15029, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo, but the hand seems to be at an alkward angle, which slightly detracts from the photo. Also the green stripe on the left side is distracting.  Nice photo</td>', 'It''s a nice photo, but the hand seems to be at an alkward angle, which slightly detracts from the photo. Also the green stripe on the left side is distracting.  Nice photo', '2004-03-23 16:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
