(633925, 64363, 9452, '<td valign="top">Simple, sharp, great colors, meets challenge, and good composition.<br/>A perfect sample that a good photo does not need a complex object. 9 from me.</td>', 'Simple, sharp, great colors, meets challenge, and good composition.A perfect sample that a good photo does not need a complex object. 9 from me.', '2004-03-23 18:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
