(633950, 64130, 17138, '<td valign="top">thats a cool photo - shame your camera isnt as good as some of our competitors. i can relate with that with my little point and shoot. no points lost for it.</td>', 'thats a cool photo - shame your camera isnt as good as some of our competitors. i can relate with that with my little point and shoot. no points lost for it.', '2004-03-23 18:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(633951, 64691, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''d have preferred this on a plainer background.</td>', 'I''d have preferred this on a plainer background.', '2004-03-23 18:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(633952, 64397, 18709, '<td valign="top">This nice  glass candelabra looks just a little odd standing on the carpet,  I think it would have been better against the wall with no lines intersecting.  But that is just my opinion. The imaging is very good.</td>', 'This nice  glass candelabra looks just a little odd standing on the carpet,  I think it would have been better against the wall with no lines intersecting.  But that is just my opinion. The imaging is very good.', '2004-03-23 18:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(633954, 64834, 18709, '<td valign="top">I like the strange snaky shape of the bridge, almost as if it had been distorted somehow, and the uprights are part of the scheme.</td>', 'I like the strange snaky shape of the bridge, almost as if it had been distorted somehow, and the uprights are part of the scheme.', '2004-03-23 18:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(633955, 64845, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a novel idea, and it works.</td>', 'This is a novel idea, and it works.', '2004-03-23 18:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(633957, 64879, 18709, '<td valign="top">This is a dark picture, and the tiny relief of the opened window is very effective. <br/>It seems to be a vertical surface, but I may be wrong.</td>', 'This is a dark picture, and the tiny relief of the opened window is very effective. It seems to be a vertical surface, but I may be wrong.', '2004-03-23 18:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(633962, 64188, 18709, '<td valign="top">In ancient times, this might have been looked on as a portent of trouble to come.<br/>We know better; trouble comes whatever you see in the sky.   This is a very telling picture.  Taken just at the right moment, You can''t dither here.  The lacy trees at the bottom frame it very well.</td>', 'In ancient times, this might have been looked on as a portent of trouble to come.We know better; trouble comes whatever you see in the sky.   This is a very telling picture.  Taken just at the right moment, You can''t dither here.  The lacy trees at the bottom frame it very well.', '2004-03-23 18:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(633964, 64447, 18709, '<td valign="top">I must say that I like the strange angle of this building.  It is effective.  The stonework shows up clearly and the crenellated towers with the gargoyles<br/>show up well.</td>', 'I must say that I like the strange angle of this building.  It is effective.  The stonework shows up clearly and the crenellated towers with the gargoylesshow up well.', '2004-03-23 18:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(633965, 64426, 18709, '<td valign="top">The silhouettes produces by the stark contrast of the bright sunshine and the deep shade give this picture great character. Or is it sunshine, it looks more like floodlighting, whichever it is it is very good.</td>', 'The silhouettes produces by the stark contrast of the bright sunshine and the deep shade give this picture great character. Or is it sunshine, it looks more like floodlighting, whichever it is it is very good.', '2004-03-23 19:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(633969, 64576, 8860, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and contrast in this, but I think a lower viewpoint would be better so that you don''t see the surface of the steps. It would give an intersting sense of design to the shot rather than giving the game away too easily. Lovely colour - and would have been good in the Orange challenge too!</td>', 'I like the textures and contrast in this, but I think a lower viewpoint would be better so that you don''t see the surface of the steps. It would give an intersting sense of design to the shot rather than giving the game away too easily. Lovely colour - and would have been good in the Orange challenge too!', '2004-03-23 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(633970, 64897, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the toning, very moody. The runner gives it some perspective and additional interest but steals the mood away somewhat. It''s a good shot.</td>', 'I like the toning, very moody. The runner gives it some perspective and additional interest but steals the mood away somewhat. It''s a good shot.', '2004-03-23 19:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(633971, 64825, 18709, '<td valign="top">You lose a little definition, photographing through the aircraft window, but it is better than crawling out onto the wing.  Warmer too I would think. Seriously this works very well.  If the plkane had been any lower, the patchwork of fields in the coun tryside might have made the picture messy, but at that height, they more or less blend into a blurry background, and don''t interfere with your scheme.</td>', 'You lose a little definition, photographing through the aircraft window, but it is better than crawling out onto the wing.  Warmer too I would think. Seriously this works very well.  If the plkane had been any lower, the patchwork of fields in the coun tryside might have made the picture messy, but at that height, they more or less blend into a blurry background, and don''t interfere with your scheme.', '2004-03-23 19:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(633974, 64316, 9452, '<td valign="top">Ohh! you really are a good counter. :)</td>', 'Ohh! you really are a good counter. :)', '2004-03-23 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(633976, 64875, 18709, '<td valign="top">You have prepared this very carefully, and the lighting is most effective.  How many squeezes did it take till you got it just right.   I like this.</td>', 'You have prepared this very carefully, and the lighting is most effective.  How many squeezes did it take till you got it just right.   I like this.', '2004-03-23 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(633977, 64992, 6008, '<td valign="top">The composition is good and shows off both the curves of the guitar and the lines of the strings, with the rose as an added interest - also goes with the romantic spanish/acoustic guitar. Only suggestion would have been to have a light on the left hand side or something to bounce the light back to fill in the dark area on the strings made from the rose shadow.</td>', 'The composition is good and shows off both the curves of the guitar and the lines of the strings, with the rose as an added interest - also goes with the romantic spanish/acoustic guitar. Only suggestion would have been to have a light on the left hand side or something to bounce the light back to fill in the dark area on the strings made from the rose shadow.', '2004-03-23 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(633978, 64780, 9452, '<td valign="top">Excelent! first place for sure. I hope. ;)</td>', 'Excelent! first place for sure. I hope. ;)', '2004-03-23 19:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(633979, 64553, 8860, '<td valign="top">Apart from your spelling of ''parallel'' with its extra ''r'', this is intriguing but the DOF is quite unnecessary. I would have preferred a narrow DOF on parallel lines of text running horizontally rather than focusing on one vertical white gap and another that is off-focus.</td>', 'Apart from your spelling of ''parallel'' with its extra ''r'', this is intriguing but the DOF is quite unnecessary. I would have preferred a narrow DOF on parallel lines of text running horizontally rather than focusing on one vertical white gap and another that is off-focus.', '2004-03-23 19:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(633980, 65029, 16930, '<td valign="top">This is the best face in the challenge(without a doubt) ... just for being cute and I love the tint you get a 10 from me.</td>', 'This is the best face in the challenge(without a doubt) ... just for being cute and I love the tint you get a 10 from me.', '2004-03-23 19:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(633981, 64718, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good toning and nice mood. I like the textures on the bark of the foreground trees, but find the background a little too bright.</td>', 'Good toning and nice mood. I like the textures on the bark of the foreground trees, but find the background a little too bright.', '2004-03-23 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(633982, 64772, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and well lit subject. I like it, but wonder what it would have looked like with the top of the object cropped - it looks quite dynamic when I view it blocked out (panoramic format). I''m not sure how active the background really is.</td>', 'Lovely colours and well lit subject. I like it, but wonder what it would have looked like with the top of the object cropped - it looks quite dynamic when I view it blocked out (panoramic format). I''m not sure how active the background really is.', '2004-03-23 19:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(633983, 64886, 6008, '<td valign="top">That looks very remote indeed. The muted colors and low clouds give it a great isolated, remote, and somewhat chilly feel. The curve of the path is good, well placed, and makes me wonder what is just over that hill. Good shot!</td>', 'That looks very remote indeed. The muted colors and low clouds give it a great isolated, remote, and somewhat chilly feel. The curve of the path is good, well placed, and makes me wonder what is just over that hill. Good shot!', '2004-03-23 19:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(633984, 64228, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, texture and clarity. Would have cropped bottom a little more.</td>', 'Nice lighting, texture and clarity. Would have cropped bottom a little more.', '2004-03-23 19:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
