(634850, 64848, 10635, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your votes.  Again, this is my highest placing yet!<br/> <br/>In answer to some of your questions. <br/>No, not tricky photography, although I dont think you mean''t it like that.  It was right place right time.  In fact I had time to get a better position, and then wait for them to look in the right direction.  <br/>The boat was a shame, but I managed to position it between the posts.  There was actually 5 birds in a row, but there would have been 1 blank post, and they would have been smaller.</td>', 'Thank you all for your votes.  Again, this is my highest placing yet! In answer to some of your questions. No, not tricky photography, although I dont think you mean''t it like that.  It was right place right time.  In fact I had time to get a better position, and then wait for them to look in the right direction.  The boat was a shame, but I managed to position it between the posts.  There was actually 5 birds in a row, but there would have been 1 blank post, and they would have been smaller.', '2004-03-24 04:48:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(634853, 64343, 14603, '<td valign="top">Expected to see this finish much higher.<br/> <br/>Good work Jon.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'Expected to see this finish much higher. Good work Jon. Gordon', '2004-03-24 04:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(634878, 64362, 6576, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your great comments.  Thanks for your votes.  This is a picture of the blinds in front of my bay window with a leave coming thru the blinds.  Thanks. Peggy</td>', 'Thanks for all your great comments.  Thanks for your votes.  This is a picture of the blinds in front of my bay window with a leave coming thru the blinds.  Thanks. Peggy', '2004-03-24 05:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(634900, 64886, 14603, '<td valign="top">Jon, having been to many similar places on a number of occasions in weather very like that in your picture, I know that there is a gloomy and desolate feel that is hard to do justice to in a small image.<br/>I applaud your attempt..however, as I feared, it does not seem to show up too well on the average monitor.<br/>Maybe something as simple as one shaft of light falling on the side of a hill and bringing out some colour would have made the difference.<br/> <br/>Once the weather up here improves slightly, I hope to "get up them hills" and try for something similar.<br/> <br/>Very difficult subject..well tackled.</td>', 'Jon, having been to many similar places on a number of occasions in weather very like that in your picture, I know that there is a gloomy and desolate feel that is hard to do justice to in a small image.I applaud your attempt..however, as I feared, it does not seem to show up too well on the average monitor.Maybe something as simple as one shaft of light falling on the side of a hill and bringing out some colour would have made the difference. Once the weather up here improves slightly, I hope to "get up them hills" and try for something similar. Very difficult subject..well tackled.', '2004-03-24 05:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(634906, 64244, 11068, '<td valign="top">Thanks you all for your votes and comments, I am very pleased whit this result.<br/> <br/>Gary, see you on the Canon PowerShot A-Series Users Group.<br/> <br/>Harm Middelbosch</td>', 'Thanks you all for your votes and comments, I am very pleased whit this result. Gary, see you on the Canon PowerShot A-Series Users Group. Harm Middelbosch', '2004-03-24 05:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(634925, 64676, 14603, '<td valign="top">4.7 average for an image of this quality is unbelievable.<br/>My take on that is that you have suffered because the parallel links were not of the obvious or expected kind and the large volume of submissions for this challenge meant that people did not spend too much time looking.<br/> <br/>Great work Terry.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', '4.7 average for an image of this quality is unbelievable.My take on that is that you have suffered because the parallel links were not of the obvious or expected kind and the large volume of submissions for this challenge meant that people did not spend too much time looking. Great work Terry. Gordon', '2004-03-24 05:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
