(636572, 64338, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi Zoomdak...<br/> <br/>I didn''t find much interest in this particular photo.  The colors are not brilliant enought to spark my interest.  Mabye the lighting is too weak overall.  I suppose it does meet the challenge, but I don''t understand any relationships within the image.  I couldn''t determine if you had any intent with the photo other than to meet the challenge in some way and create some amount of impact with the spider.  <br/> <br/>I''m a tough cookie because I look for things in photographs that aren''t always there.  A theme or overall idea is one of the primary things I look for.  What''s the purpose? Does this photo speak to me in any way?  <br/> <br/>Good luck in future challenges :)<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi Zoomdak... I didn''t find much interest in this particular photo.  The colors are not brilliant enought to spark my interest.  Mabye the lighting is too weak overall.  I suppose it does meet the challenge, but I don''t understand any relationships within the image.  I couldn''t determine if you had any intent with the photo other than to meet the challenge in some way and create some amount of impact with the spider.   I''m a tough cookie because I look for things in photographs that aren''t always there.  A theme or overall idea is one of the primary things I look for.  What''s the purpose? Does this photo speak to me in any way?   Good luck in future challenges :) John Setzler', '2004-03-24 18:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
