(637245, 64452, 5792, '<td valign="top">Frank, This interesting shot was one of my top three picks for this challenge. Great photograph. You didn''t get a ribbon but 5th ain''t bad at all.<br/> <br/>I see you are from Edmonds, WA. I am originally from the Pacific Northwest and am very curious what that is supposed to be and where it is located.</td>', 'Frank, This interesting shot was one of my top three picks for this challenge. Great photograph. You didn''t get a ribbon but 5th ain''t bad at all. I see you are from Edmonds, WA. I am originally from the Pacific Northwest and am very curious what that is supposed to be and where it is located.', '2004-03-25 01:37:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(637469, 64869, 15832, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Hax0r:</b></div><hr/><i> 45 people gave this a 1 - 3. That''s astonishing. What am I missing about this photo? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the support...<br/>I really tought i would get scored over 6 this time but hey... alot of people thougt diffrent. <br/> <br/>It´s sad that nobody of those 45 people couldn´t tell me why they scored me so low so i could have learn´t something out of it. I got only good comments but low score.</td>', 'Originally posted by Hax0r: 45 people gave this a 1 - 3. That''s astonishing. What am I missing about this photo?   Thanks for the support...I really tought i would get scored over 6 this time but hey... alot of people thougt diffrent.  It´s sad that nobody of those 45 people couldn´t tell me why they scored me so low so i could have learn´t something out of it. I got only good comments but low score.', '2004-03-25 06:53:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(638119, 64780, 13688, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for all the kind words.</td>', 'Thanks to all for all the kind words.', '2004-03-25 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(639165, 64362, 17485, '<td valign="top">Forgive me, but what exactly is this?  Blinds?  If so, what kind of blinds give this type of pattern?  I''m just not seeing what is so keen in this picture.  Sorry if that offends, but I just don''t see a 2nd place finish in this shot, compared to others in the group.  To me, this looks more like something done in Photoshop than the works of photography.  Please correct me and prove me wrong.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-03-26 00:24:08.</i></td>', 'Forgive me, but what exactly is this?  Blinds?  If so, what kind of blinds give this type of pattern?  I''m just not seeing what is so keen in this picture.  Sorry if that offends, but I just don''t see a 2nd place finish in this shot, compared to others in the group.  To me, this looks more like something done in Photoshop than the works of photography.  Please correct me and prove me wrong.', '2004-03-26 00:21:50.000000', '2004-03-26 00:24:08.000000', 0),
(639175, 64507, 17485, '<td valign="top">The clouds look fake to me, something of the sort of "Difference Clouds" as produced with Photoshop.  Maybe not, but it just looks like it could have been rendered rather than captured.  Not to offend, just to question the possibility.  I liked this image, the clouds just gave me a 2nd guess.  Regardless, congrats on the win and the numerous other wins under your belt.  You''ve definitely got a good thing going.</td>', 'The clouds look fake to me, something of the sort of "Difference Clouds" as produced with Photoshop.  Maybe not, but it just looks like it could have been rendered rather than captured.  Not to offend, just to question the possibility.  I liked this image, the clouds just gave me a 2nd guess.  Regardless, congrats on the win and the numerous other wins under your belt.  You''ve definitely got a good thing going.', '2004-03-26 00:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
