(687323, 64638, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very nice and strong composition. Would''ve done wonderful in the "Silence" challenge as well, IMO. Have you tried experimenting in rotating the image slightly so the bleachers are perfectly horizontal?<br/> <br/>After a while, all those horizontal lines start to play tricks on my eyes!</td>', 'Very nice and strong composition. Would''ve done wonderful in the "Silence" challenge as well, IMO. Have you tried experimenting in rotating the image slightly so the bleachers are perfectly horizontal? After a while, all those horizontal lines start to play tricks on my eyes!', '2004-04-27 12:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
