(705604, 64867, 15822, '<td valign="top">I agree with some of the comments so far, but I don''t think the boy spoils the picture at all. I don''t know if you intended it but the shot reminds me of The Scream by Edvard Munch (//www.popartuk.com/art/the-scream-6410033-print.asp). The contrast of the pleasant beach and the quite happy looking boy is an entertaining contrast with the anguish and panic in Munch''s painting. And so much more subtle than the Home Alone version.</td>', 'I agree with some of the comments so far, but I don''t think the boy spoils the picture at all. I don''t know if you intended it but the shot reminds me of The Scream by Edvard Munch (//www.popartuk.com/art/the-scream-6410033-print.asp). The contrast of the pleasant beach and the quite happy looking boy is an entertaining contrast with the anguish and panic in Munch''s painting. And so much more subtle than the Home Alone version.', '2004-05-08 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
