(952111, 65017, 21183, '<td valign="top">Thank you for sharing this with me on the ''mist'' thread.  There are so many aspects of your photograph that bring to life some of the words of the poem on the thread.  There is an incredible ''balance'' to your photo - created by the two trees reflected on the water. The backgrounds of mist, softening the trees beyond, create a lovely backdrop to the scene.</td>', 'Thank you for sharing this with me on the ''mist'' thread.  There are so many aspects of your photograph that bring to life some of the words of the poem on the thread.  There is an incredible ''balance'' to your photo - created by the two trees reflected on the water. The backgrounds of mist, softening the trees beyond, create a lovely backdrop to the scene.', '2004-10-09 18:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1481887, 65001, 16488, '<td valign="top">Well, despite your perfect "5" you can take heart that so many commentors "got it"!  It really is perfect for the challenge...and beyond.  The tension and playfulness of line in this image should make those under-five voters ashamed!  (and if this is your average by the voters, well, I''ll just sit here and be jealous)<br/> <br/>Thanks for playing in the "closest to 5" thread today!</td>', 'Well, despite your perfect "5" you can take heart that so many commentors "got it"!  It really is perfect for the challenge...and beyond.  The tension and playfulness of line in this image should make those under-five voters ashamed!  (and if this is your average by the voters, well, I''ll just sit here and be jealous) Thanks for playing in the "closest to 5" thread today!', '2005-06-24 19:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1482213, 65001, 8891, '<td valign="top">Thanks, KaDi! I appreciate your comment very much. I shot this again a week or so later and processed without the hampering Open Challenge basic editiing rules. The shadow line of light and shadow is better placed, but there are aspects of the original I like better.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=66450" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/66450.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/66450.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8891/thumb/66450.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks, KaDi! I appreciate your comment very much. I shot this again a week or so later and processed without the hampering Open Challenge basic editiing rules. The shadow line of light and shadow is better placed, but there are aspects of the original I like better. ', '2005-06-24 23:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1559825, 64889, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like the composition, but think that the top portion of the shot is a little busy (all the tiny tree limbs) and the lighting is a little harsh.  The lines are great - they take you right through the entire image very nicely.  Also interesting subject matter to me personally.  I think it''s a keeper!  :-)</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like the composition, but think that the top portion of the shot is a little busy (all the tiny tree limbs) and the lighting is a little harsh.  The lines are great - they take you right through the entire image very nicely.  Also interesting subject matter to me personally.  I think it''s a keeper!  :-)', '2005-07-25 00:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
